(597306, 62017, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hey I''m all for gratuitous nudity, but I don''t get what you are trying to say with this shot.  Nice focus, great B/W treatment (in fact I would love to see the color version so I see how you got from one to another) but I don''t get it.  Why does she have a sword growing out of her navel?  Or is she trying to cut off that shiny growth?  Or is she trying to give herself another piercing....  I''m confused....<br/>TC</td>', 'Hey I''m all for gratuitous nudity, but I don''t get what you are trying to say with this shot.  Nice focus, great B/W treatment (in fact I would love to see the color version so I see how you got from one to another) but I don''t get it.  Why does she have a sword growing out of her navel?  Or is she trying to cut off that shiny growth?  Or is she trying to give herself another piercing....  I''m confused....TC', '2004-02-25 03:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(597309, 61599, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL  I love this shot for it''s nostalgia!  Wonder if the younger crowd will get it.  Your lighting is a little harsh though.  Did you use on board flash here?  I''m not sure as the harshness seems to be coming from the top...  Some fill lighting and a little more exposure controll and this would be an awesome shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL  I love this shot for it''s nostalgia!  Wonder if the younger crowd will get it.  Your lighting is a little harsh though.  Did you use on board flash here?  I''m not sure as the harshness seems to be coming from the top...  Some fill lighting and a little more exposure controll and this would be an awesome shot!TC', '2004-02-25 03:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
