(598045, 61642, 16648, '<td valign="top">i thought of this very pic..however, i was doing to use each camer''s flash as the lighting ...then i had an easier idea.  the front of the digi cam is not lit well - a softbox or bounce card would have helped. not sure i like the shodows i see between cameras and behind the digicam</td>', 'i thought of this very pic..however, i was doing to use each camer''s flash as the lighting ...then i had an easier idea.  the front of the digi cam is not lit well - a softbox or bounce card would have helped. not sure i like the shodows i see between cameras and behind the digicam', '2004-02-25 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
