(598048, 62100, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the conflict is between the warmth of the tower to the cold of the outside?  Or is it the classical fight of good (the church) vs. evil (the outside world).  So it meets the challenge on either of those levels.<br/> <br/>As for the shot, the white roof (?) on the bottom left is very distracting to me.  If you were to crop just above that line and still keep the door in the shot it would make a huge difference on my score.  The contrast is also just a bit wanting.  A 6</td>', 'I''m guessing the conflict is between the warmth of the tower to the cold of the outside?  Or is it the classical fight of good (the church) vs. evil (the outside world).  So it meets the challenge on either of those levels. As for the shot, the white roof (?) on the bottom left is very distracting to me.  If you were to crop just above that line and still keep the door in the shot it would make a huge difference on my score.  The contrast is also just a bit wanting.  A 6', '2004-02-25 13:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(598049, 61938, 3351, '<td valign="top">man vs dirt. ouch. it would be better if the picture was less blurry.</td>', 'man vs dirt. ouch. it would be better if the picture was less blurry.', '2004-02-25 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
