(598051, 62112, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, conflict with the game.  Those games are hard too but I had to really look to try to see what he was playing.  Maybe a different angle that showed a bit more of the game and a look of fustration on the model''s face?  The black and white works well here but the focus seems to be on the lettering on the shirt, overall sharper focus would really help the shot pop for me.  A 6</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, conflict with the game.  Those games are hard too but I had to really look to try to see what he was playing.  Maybe a different angle that showed a bit more of the game and a look of fustration on the model''s face?  The black and white works well here but the focus seems to be on the lettering on the shirt, overall sharper focus would really help the shot pop for me.  A 6', '2004-02-25 13:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
