(598406, 61921, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good timing.  Might have looked better if the camera would allow a closer shot, if the flame was a little less red or if the background was darkened.  I suppose basic editing might not allow.</td>', 'Good timing.  Might have looked better if the camera would allow a closer shot, if the flame was a little less red or if the background was darkened.  I suppose basic editing might not allow.', '2004-02-25 16:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(598408, 62090, 16982, '<td valign="top">That is excellent! 10.</td>', 'That is excellent! 10.', '2004-02-25 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(598411, 62107, 16982, '<td valign="top">Nice greens, good focus on the seed and good contrast.  Extra point for the title!</td>', 'Nice greens, good focus on the seed and good contrast.  Extra point for the title!', '2004-02-25 16:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(598413, 62106, 16982, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure; shame about the coloured smudges below the cross.</td>', 'Nice exposure; shame about the coloured smudges below the cross.', '2004-02-25 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(598419, 61482, 7889, '<td valign="top">Wow! Fantastic photograph, I can feel the conflit, colours are outstanding. Great work. Must be a high finish for you.</td>', 'Wow! Fantastic photograph, I can feel the conflit, colours are outstanding. Great work. Must be a high finish for you.', '2004-02-25 16:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(598420, 61229, 16982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you got so close to that sparrow!  Or if you zoomed in, I don''t know how you got such a good background.  Loses a few marks from me due to divergence from the subject "conflct".</td>', 'I don''t know how you got so close to that sparrow!  Or if you zoomed in, I don''t know how you got such a good background.  Loses a few marks from me due to divergence from the subject "conflct".', '2004-02-25 16:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(598424, 61410, 16982, '<td valign="top">Just a bit blurry.  More light might have imprroved colours.  Arrangement of subjects questionable?  Sorry for being so negative!</td>', 'Just a bit blurry.  More light might have imprroved colours.  Arrangement of subjects questionable?  Sorry for being so negative!', '2004-02-25 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(598425, 61965, 13547, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this would make sense if i could remember what the letters stood for!  Nice pic, great detail, good use of b&amp;w</td>', 'I''m sure this would make sense if i could remember what the letters stood for!  Nice pic, great detail, good use of b&w', '2004-02-25 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(598427, 61517, 16672, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in the sky just everything else is way to dark.</td>', 'I love the colors in the sky just everything else is way to dark.', '2004-02-25 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(598429, 61432, 13547, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, excellent detail.  A little bright towards the bottom on either side of the girl.  I like the fact we have two or three little ''sotries'' going on here as well.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, excellent detail.  A little bright towards the bottom on either side of the girl.  I like the fact we have two or three little ''sotries'' going on here as well.', '2004-02-25 16:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(598432, 62000, 13547, '<td valign="top">The guy on the right has a slightly blurred forehead, other than that very crisp, great use of shadows &amp; cropping</td>', 'The guy on the right has a slightly blurred forehead, other than that very crisp, great use of shadows & cropping', '2004-02-25 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(598437, 62004, 13547, '<td valign="top">Quite a bold statement there!  I think the lighting could be a bit better here, I''d like to see more of the thumb and that side of the hand.</td>', 'Quite a bold statement there!  I think the lighting could be a bit better here, I''d like to see more of the thumb and that side of the hand.', '2004-02-25 16:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(598440, 61934, 13547, '<td valign="top">Hehe! I was gonna do something like this but I couldn''t find my action men figures...  Nice pic, love the eerie lighting!  Objects in the background are a little distracting tho.</td>', 'Hehe! I was gonna do something like this but I couldn''t find my action men figures...  Nice pic, love the eerie lighting!  Objects in the background are a little distracting tho.', '2004-02-25 17:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(598442, 61775, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good movement but is the focus off a little?</td>', 'Good movement but is the focus off a little?', '2004-02-25 17:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(598444, 62140, 13547, '<td valign="top">Very evocative statement here, probably one of the very few metaphorical ones that will do well I think!  I''d like to see it done in black and white, but you might lose the impact of the scar.</td>', 'Very evocative statement here, probably one of the very few metaphorical ones that will do well I think!  I''d like to see it done in black and white, but you might lose the impact of the scar.', '2004-02-25 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(598446, 61726, 16982, '<td valign="top">Very good colours on the grass and sky.</td>', 'Very good colours on the grass and sky.', '2004-02-25 17:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(598447, 61985, 13547, '<td valign="top">maybe a bit more light is needed, esp. on the left, but it''s a great shot!</td>', 'maybe a bit more light is needed, esp. on the left, but it''s a great shot!', '2004-02-25 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(598448, 61353, 13547, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, shame about the noise in the background!  The trees are a little distracting as well.</td>', 'Nice idea, shame about the noise in the background!  The trees are a little distracting as well.', '2004-02-25 17:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(598449, 61797, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really effective photograph. I like that you didn''t just fall into the trap of making it black and white. It''s much more vivid in colour. You really captured the mood well. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a really effective photograph. I like that you didn''t just fall into the trap of making it black and white. It''s much more vivid in colour. You really captured the mood well. Good luck!', '2004-02-25 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(598450, 61932, 13547, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Best laugh I''ve had all day!  Great idea, I hope people see it in the same light as I did!  My only criticism is that you seem to have lost the edges of the egg on the far left.  Other than that, brilliant!</td>', 'Love it!  Best laugh I''ve had all day!  Great idea, I hope people see it in the same light as I did!  My only criticism is that you seem to have lost the edges of the egg on the far left.  Other than that, brilliant!', '2004-02-25 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(598451, 62168, 15207, '<td valign="top">Hey...great find. I like what you''ve done with this challenge theme. This is also very well composed.</td>', 'Hey...great find. I like what you''ve done with this challenge theme. This is also very well composed.', '2004-02-25 17:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(598452, 61802, 13547, '<td valign="top">Apple vs. MSN Messenger surely?!</td>', 'Apple vs. MSN Messenger surely?!', '2004-02-25 17:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
