(598457, 62154, 15207, '<td valign="top">Quite a few people seem to have similar ideas... but yours has a quality all its own.  I think you captured the mood very well...your model''s expression is perfect. I also like that the one model''s tatoo actually balances the photo. I even like that one of the model''s fingers is a bit dirty...just perfect! Your use of DOF is dead on for this image. Good luck!</td>', 'Quite a few people seem to have similar ideas... but yours has a quality all its own.  I think you captured the mood very well...your model''s expression is perfect. I also like that the one model''s tatoo actually balances the photo. I even like that one of the model''s fingers is a bit dirty...just perfect! Your use of DOF is dead on for this image. Good luck!', '2004-02-25 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(598460, 61979, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really really like this one. I love the metaphor!  Plus, it''s a good composition with excellent detail.</td>', 'I really really like this one. I love the metaphor!  Plus, it''s a good composition with excellent detail.', '2004-02-25 17:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
