(598466, 61932, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really really like this one. I love the glow-in-the-dark chicken feet. It''s well composed and has a nice bit of humour. You obviously took the time to get the details right -- including your lighting. Good luck!</td>', 'I really really like this one. I love the glow-in-the-dark chicken feet. It''s well composed and has a nice bit of humour. You obviously took the time to get the details right -- including your lighting. Good luck!', '2004-02-25 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
