(598496, 62090, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love this one. The colours are so vivid. Plus, the details are crisp and it''s wellcomposed. It''s nice to see some quality in this challenge. Good luck!!</td>', 'I love this one. The colours are so vivid. Plus, the details are crisp and it''s wellcomposed. It''s nice to see some quality in this challenge. Good luck!!', '2004-02-25 17:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
