(598723, 61934, 17505, '<td valign="top">This would have been a much better picture if there were a solid black background. I find the indistinct things in the background very distracting. That said, I still rated it above average.</td>', 'This would have been a much better picture if there were a solid black background. I find the indistinct things in the background very distracting. That said, I still rated it above average.', '2004-02-25 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(598728, 61651, 17342, '<td valign="top">focus on the stain not on the tommy</td>', 'focus on the stain not on the tommy', '2004-02-25 18:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(598732, 61588, 17342, '<td valign="top">this is a really fun shot! 8</td>', 'this is a really fun shot! 8', '2004-02-25 18:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(598733, 61171, 12253, '<td valign="top">An excellent composition and exposure, good choice of B&amp;W.  Some minor hot spots on upper forehead, but but IMHO the main problem is simply that your neatimage settings are too high, giving the skin a plastic look rather than just clean of noise.  Also, you can see signs of oversharpening by the lashes and eye brow.</td>', 'An excellent composition and exposure, good choice of B&W.  Some minor hot spots on upper forehead, but but IMHO the main problem is simply that your neatimage settings are too high, giving the skin a plastic look rather than just clean of noise.  Also, you can see signs of oversharpening by the lashes and eye brow.', '2004-02-25 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(598734, 62128, 179, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of my favs. Everything comes together in this. It depicts the conflict quite brilliantly. If I had only one obnoxious thing to say is that I don''t like the little line at the far right, but that''s really streaching it. Score: 10 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'This has to be one of my favs. Everything comes together in this. It depicts the conflict quite brilliantly. If I had only one obnoxious thing to say is that I don''t like the little line at the far right, but that''s really streaching it. Score: 10 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-25 18:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(598736, 61651, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, very good composition.  One issue: The uneven lighting and folds on the left side and front left of the shirt is a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'Cute idea, very good composition.  One issue: The uneven lighting and folds on the left side and front left of the shirt is a bit distracting to me.', '2004-02-25 18:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(598738, 61996, 179, '<td valign="top">A brilliant depiction of the challenge. I''m sorry to say I have nothing bad nor constructive to say about this entry. I know that''s not what people want to hear, but hey when it''s good it''s good! Score: 10 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'A brilliant depiction of the challenge. I''m sorry to say I have nothing bad nor constructive to say about this entry. I know that''s not what people want to hear, but hey when it''s good it''s good! Score: 10 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-25 18:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(598741, 62090, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done studio shot, almost perfect but the pink seems to be poluted from an earlier attempt.  Also, it would have been cool to have the pink meeting the yellow like the blue meets it so they all reach for the foreground.</td>', 'Well done studio shot, almost perfect but the pink seems to be poluted from an earlier attempt.  Also, it would have been cool to have the pink meeting the yellow like the blue meets it so they all reach for the foreground.', '2004-02-25 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(598744, 62167, 17342, '<td valign="top">nice action photos with a lot of emotion</td>', 'nice action photos with a lot of emotion', '2004-02-25 19:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(598746, 62143, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent social commentary.  Minor nits: on my monitor at least, the exposure on the boy is too dark; I wish the sign looked more real and less like a quick laser printout tacked to the wall (it looks too fake, which I assume and hope it was!) , and I think the DOF should have included the sign.</td>', 'Excellent social commentary.  Minor nits: on my monitor at least, the exposure on the boy is too dark; I wish the sign looked more real and less like a quick laser printout tacked to the wall (it looks too fake, which I assume and hope it was!) , and I think the DOF should have included the sign.', '2004-02-25 19:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(598747, 61764, 17342, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots from this challenge. Beautiful use of slow shutter speed to show personal conflict, and the tone is nice, too. 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots from this challenge. Beautiful use of slow shutter speed to show personal conflict, and the tone is nice, too. 10', '2004-02-25 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(598748, 61921, 17342, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites, really love the drop in the flame 9</td>', 'One of my favorites, really love the drop in the flame 9', '2004-02-25 19:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(598749, 61988, 179, '<td valign="top">A good depiction of the challenge. I scored this quite low and this is why: the low resolution of this photo makes it quite grainy and that is distracting to the eye. Nothing is really in focus so nothing really stands out. I don''t know if this is due to compression. The sepia tones aren''t contrasted enough for me and I would have liked it better in B&amp;W maybe. It''s a shame because the subject was right on. Score: 4 Good job nonetheless! Good luck!</td>', 'A good depiction of the challenge. I scored this quite low and this is why: the low resolution of this photo makes it quite grainy and that is distracting to the eye. Nothing is really in focus so nothing really stands out. I don''t know if this is due to compression. The sepia tones aren''t contrasted enough for me and I would have liked it better in B&W maybe. It''s a shame because the subject was right on. Score: 4 Good job nonetheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-25 19:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(598751, 62065, 179, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what the conflict is in this photo. It''s a nicely done photo, but for me it doesn''t depict the challenge. Score:4 Nice job nonetheless. Good Luck!</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what the conflict is in this photo. It''s a nicely done photo, but for me it doesn''t depict the challenge. Score:4 Nice job nonetheless. Good Luck!', '2004-02-25 19:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(598754, 61295, 17375, '<td valign="top">heaven?  hell?  that looks like earth....bad conflict....the photo doesnt illustrate your title or a conflict at all...</td>', 'heaven?  hell?  that looks like earth....bad conflict....the photo doesnt illustrate your title or a conflict at all...', '2004-02-25 19:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(598757, 61845, 179, '<td valign="top">Okay, I was going to say that this wasn''t a conflict photo until I noticed the two forks, subtle and brilliant idea! The only problem I have with this shot now is that it needs a little more contrast. A clever idea nonetheless! Score :5  Nicely done and good luck!</td>', 'Okay, I was going to say that this wasn''t a conflict photo until I noticed the two forks, subtle and brilliant idea! The only problem I have with this shot now is that it needs a little more contrast. A clever idea nonetheless! Score :5  Nicely done and good luck!', '2004-02-25 19:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(598771, 61911, 17375, '<td valign="top">Conflict huh?  There is NO conflict here...</td>', 'Conflict huh?  There is NO conflict here...', '2004-02-25 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(598772, 61932, 179, '<td valign="top">This one just cracks me up! (no pun intended) . If I had to find something bothersome about this shot it would only be the greyish tone at the top, but even that is streaching it. Excellent depiction of the challenge, funny and original. Score: 10 Awesome job, good luck!</td>', 'This one just cracks me up! (no pun intended) . If I had to find something bothersome about this shot it would only be the greyish tone at the top, but even that is streaching it. Excellent depiction of the challenge, funny and original. Score: 10 Awesome job, good luck!', '2004-02-25 19:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(598774, 61985, 17375, '<td valign="top">I liked this alot...not to sure why but it was definatly the best chess conflict out of all of them....the representation is well placed and the idea of looking down the line is unique</td>', 'I liked this alot...not to sure why but it was definatly the best chess conflict out of all of them....the representation is well placed and the idea of looking down the line is unique', '2004-02-25 19:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(598778, 61802, 179, '<td valign="top">This has the potential of a great shot. Original and funny and a nice depiction of the challenge. The problems I have with this shot are these:<br/>- the contrast could be boosted up, easy thing to do in post processing.<br/>- the light source is directly in front of the apple which to me is a bit distractng, a softer   light at another angle could fix this.<br/>Score: 5<br/>Good job nonetheless! Good luck!</td>', 'This has the potential of a great shot. Original and funny and a nice depiction of the challenge. The problems I have with this shot are these:- the contrast could be boosted up, easy thing to do in post processing.- the light source is directly in front of the apple which to me is a bit distractng, a softer   light at another angle could fix this.Score: 5Good job nonetheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-25 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(598781, 61462, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I/m not sure the exposure or the shadowing is right.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I/m not sure the exposure or the shadowing is right.', '2004-02-25 19:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
