(598831, 62081, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal. The title explains a lot and the animal standing on the road really says a lot once you know what to look for. Excellent statement on a sad situation!</td>', 'Beautiful animal. The title explains a lot and the animal standing on the road really says a lot once you know what to look for. Excellent statement on a sad situation!', '2004-02-25 20:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(598833, 62090, 14476, '<td valign="top">Actually these colors go together quite nicely(red/blue/yellow = primarys), but I do like your take on the Challenge and I like the way you melded the colors without mixing them.  Nicely photographed.  9  Good Luck</td>', 'Actually these colors go together quite nicely(red/blue/yellow = primarys), but I do like your take on the Challenge and I like the way you melded the colors without mixing them.  Nicely photographed.  9  Good Luck', '2004-02-25 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(598835, 61482, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice poses, and the colors really add a lot to the tension. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice poses, and the colors really add a lot to the tension. Good Job.', '2004-02-25 20:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(598836, 62117, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good use of your camera.</td>', 'Good use of your camera.', '2004-02-25 20:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(598839, 61929, 17505, '<td valign="top">Perfect. It''s an endangered animal, right? That''s the only trouble, if that''s not the conflict I don''t know what it is.</td>', 'Perfect. It''s an endangered animal, right? That''s the only trouble, if that''s not the conflict I don''t know what it is.', '2004-02-25 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(598840, 62092, 17033, '<td valign="top">I preferred Temple of Conflict</td>', 'I preferred Temple of Conflict', '2004-02-25 20:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(598841, 62139, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, good one!  Well thought out.  While I wish it was just a bit sharper on the left, it is still worth a 9 for an exceptionally good take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Oh, good one!  Well thought out.  While I wish it was just a bit sharper on the left, it is still worth a 9 for an exceptionally good take on the Challenge.', '2004-02-25 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(598843, 62034, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice! How long did it take you to get this photo? Does he do this all the time or was it a chance occurance? What is in the hole? Ants? Some other food?</td>', 'Nice! How long did it take you to get this photo? Does he do this all the time or was it a chance occurance? What is in the hole? Ants? Some other food?', '2004-02-25 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(598844, 61644, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, I was looking for some of these arrows, which always show up when I don''t need them.  You found them, and it''s a super story.  9</td>', 'Oh, I was looking for some of these arrows, which always show up when I don''t need them.  You found them, and it''s a super story.  9', '2004-02-25 20:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
