(599719, 61456, 16731, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; I like the branches against the black and white.  Nice job of having the buds show up, too.</td>', 'Nice composition; I like the branches against the black and white.  Nice job of having the buds show up, too.', '2004-02-26 08:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(599725, 61612, 16731, '<td valign="top">Harsh reflective glare from the flash, but overall an interesting photo.  Dones''t speak to me of "conflict", however.</td>', 'Harsh reflective glare from the flash, but overall an interesting photo.  Dones''t speak to me of "conflict", however.', '2004-02-26 09:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(599734, 61223, 16731, '<td valign="top">Not at all sure how this is supposed to show conflict.  Not a good photo technically, either...the ribbon over the face is very distracting.  The viewer has no idea of what type of balloon the ribbon is attached to; a "Happy Birthday" balloon in this setting would make all the difference in the portrayal of "conflict"</td>', 'Not at all sure how this is supposed to show conflict.  Not a good photo technically, either...the ribbon over the face is very distracting.  The viewer has no idea of what type of balloon the ribbon is attached to; a "Happy Birthday" balloon in this setting would make all the difference in the portrayal of "conflict"', '2004-02-26 09:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(599742, 62124, 16731, '<td valign="top">This photo is just plain not appealing to me in any fashion.  It''s not a technically bad photo, although it could be a bit brighter, and I do see the "conflict"...it''s just not esthetically pleasing to my eye.</td>', 'This photo is just plain not appealing to me in any fashion.  It''s not a technically bad photo, although it could be a bit brighter, and I do see the "conflict"...it''s just not esthetically pleasing to my eye.', '2004-02-26 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(599743, 61919, 16731, '<td valign="top">I had to study this picture a bit to understand the title.  The post being right in the center of the picture detracts from the crush of folks trying to get on the train.</td>', 'I had to study this picture a bit to understand the title.  The post being right in the center of the picture detracts from the crush of folks trying to get on the train.', '2004-02-26 09:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(599745, 61862, 16731, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Good color coordination between the red cherry and the red pointer.  Nice lighting, good detail.  The only thing I can see that might improve it (and I''m not sure it would be an improvement, really) would be to show the top of the scale to match with the roundness of the bowl.  I appreciate the view of "conflict" without the violence.</td>', 'Yum!  Good color coordination between the red cherry and the red pointer.  Nice lighting, good detail.  The only thing I can see that might improve it (and I''m not sure it would be an improvement, really) would be to show the top of the scale to match with the roundness of the bowl.  I appreciate the view of "conflict" without the violence.', '2004-02-26 09:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(599746, 61877, 16731, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, nice shapes;  don''t see the conflict here.</td>', 'Interesting photo, nice shapes;  don''t see the conflict here.', '2004-02-26 09:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(599749, 61343, 16731, '<td valign="top">Just for my taste, the skin is a bit too smooth and without texture; almost blurred but not quite.</td>', 'Just for my taste, the skin is a bit too smooth and without texture; almost blurred but not quite.', '2004-02-26 09:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(599750, 61726, 16731, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I wish there was a way to see the monument from the top a bit better, but this angle does show the inscription better.  Beautiful sky and setting!</td>', 'I like this photo.  I wish there was a way to see the monument from the top a bit better, but this angle does show the inscription better.  Beautiful sky and setting!', '2004-02-26 09:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(599754, 61553, 16731, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this picture, but the picture itself is not a good quality photo.  I don''t see the birdseed, and the birds, especially the black bird are not sharp and clear.  Points for originality only.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this picture, but the picture itself is not a good quality photo.  I don''t see the birdseed, and the birds, especially the black bird are not sharp and clear.  Points for originality only.', '2004-02-26 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(599757, 62152, 16731, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo.  I appreciate the careful placement of the bullet so that the writing is easily read, and the matching of the background to the silver color.  I had to look closely to see if this was a color or B/W shot and finally decided on "color".  Good positioning within the frame of the picture.  It''s obvious you pay attention to detail. The lighting glare is not good, but not too distracting either.</td>', 'Not a bad photo.  I appreciate the careful placement of the bullet so that the writing is easily read, and the matching of the background to the silver color.  I had to look closely to see if this was a color or B/W shot and finally decided on "color".  Good positioning within the frame of the picture.  It''s obvious you pay attention to detail. The lighting glare is not good, but not too distracting either.', '2004-02-26 09:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(599760, 62132, 16731, '<td valign="top">Good reflection of the topic - although if the cigarettes had been in a recognized brand, it might have been more powerful.  Lighting could be improved as for my taste there is too much shadow on the hand.</td>', 'Good reflection of the topic - although if the cigarettes had been in a recognized brand, it might have been more powerful.  Lighting could be improved as for my taste there is too much shadow on the hand.', '2004-02-26 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
