(599765, 62051, 16731, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...quite an interesting piece of art.  Not sure how it relates to "conflict", but it''s an interesting piece.</td>', 'Hmmm...quite an interesting piece of art.  Not sure how it relates to "conflict", but it''s an interesting piece.', '2004-02-26 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
