(599817, 61517, 15407, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch for me as a conflict, since it''s more like harmony having a rainbow with a storm. Its a shame you didnt have a higher vantage point over the houses as I think it would have made for a better ''photo op''. I suspect that glass &amp; program filters helped with the vibrant colors, which I like.  All in all I enjoy your picture and appreciate the fact you did the best you could with what was presented to you at the time.</td>', 'It''s a stretch for me as a conflict, since it''s more like harmony having a rainbow with a storm. Its a shame you didnt have a higher vantage point over the houses as I think it would have made for a better ''photo op''. I suspect that glass & program filters helped with the vibrant colors, which I like.  All in all I enjoy your picture and appreciate the fact you did the best you could with what was presented to you at the time.', '2004-02-26 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(599818, 62055, 16402, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise here but IMHO it actually adds to the photo. Idea is also nice.</td>', 'A lot of noise here but IMHO it actually adds to the photo. Idea is also nice.', '2004-02-26 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(599819, 62147, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of the few entries in this challenge that conveys the challenge theme accurately by content alone. Feels a little dark and could do with some fill-in lighting on the face of the girl at the left, maybe also get down to their height to take it?</td>', 'One of the few entries in this challenge that conveys the challenge theme accurately by content alone. Feels a little dark and could do with some fill-in lighting on the face of the girl at the left, maybe also get down to their height to take it?', '2004-02-26 11:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(599822, 61504, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a clever idea - that little "conflict resolution game" is a clever way to represent the theme. Composition doesn''t do anything for me - seems a bit haphazard - what shape are you looking to make with your choice of layout - the shapes of both the objects and the space around them isn''t particularly dynamic to me. I also find lighting a little uneven and DOF too shallow - that the nearer extremes of the scissors are out of focus doesn''t add to this for me.</td>', 'What a clever idea - that little "conflict resolution game" is a clever way to represent the theme. Composition doesn''t do anything for me - seems a bit haphazard - what shape are you looking to make with your choice of layout - the shapes of both the objects and the space around them isn''t particularly dynamic to me. I also find lighting a little uneven and DOF too shallow - that the nearer extremes of the scissors are out of focus doesn''t add to this for me.', '2004-02-26 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(599824, 61764, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, like the motion blur in the arm/ hand. Interesting shadow.</td>', 'Nice idea, like the motion blur in the arm/ hand. Interesting shadow.', '2004-02-26 11:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
