(599973, 61929, 6073, '<td valign="top">Was this a serious entry for this challenge? <br/> <br/>The technical merits of photo are w/o question.  Very strong in all regards.  I think I would like to try to grap the yellow underneath the eye as the trim highlight border.  Maybe you tried this and it was too much, so you made the right move.  <br/> <br/>If I stretch, I imagine the conflict is survival.  That''s a little too profoud for the knuckleheads voting.  Still rates high in my book.  Good luck.</td>', 'Was this a serious entry for this challenge?  The technical merits of photo are w/o question.  Very strong in all regards.  I think I would like to try to grap the yellow underneath the eye as the trim highlight border.  Maybe you tried this and it was too much, so you made the right move.   If I stretch, I imagine the conflict is survival.  That''s a little too profoud for the knuckleheads voting.  Still rates high in my book.  Good luck.', '2004-02-26 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(599974, 62074, 16672, '<td valign="top">You should study because your beer isn''t helping your creativity. You should have tried to mess with the lighting and your contrast to the image  and really read your book because the moral philosophy hasn''t helped you yet.</td>', 'You should study because your beer isn''t helping your creativity. You should have tried to mess with the lighting and your contrast to the image  and really read your book because the moral philosophy hasn''t helped you yet.', '2004-02-26 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
