(600521, 62121, 10959, '<td valign="top">I really had to stop and look at this one for a while--this is an easy one to dismiss with a low score.  However, that kid''s stare and expression really gets me!  Then the wife is just standing there grinning--and the husband is taking a shot--the whole scene is so surreal its almost laughable.  I think there really is A LOT of conflict here in the interplay between the people--baby vs. wife vs. husband.  Maybe I''m reading too much in to it, but I really like it! 7</td>', 'I really had to stop and look at this one for a while--this is an easy one to dismiss with a low score.  However, that kid''s stare and expression really gets me!  Then the wife is just standing there grinning--and the husband is taking a shot--the whole scene is so surreal its almost laughable.  I think there really is A LOT of conflict here in the interplay between the people--baby vs. wife vs. husband.  Maybe I''m reading too much in to it, but I really like it! 7', '2004-02-26 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
