(600591, 61965, 17720, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see the conflict - but I''d be glad to debate religion sometime.  Good shot technically.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see the conflict - but I''d be glad to debate religion sometime.  Good shot technically.', '2004-02-26 21:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(600592, 62143, 6073, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to think or feel about this.  Is that good or bad?  <br/> <br/>It will be interesting to see what you were going for.  Racially motivated statements are tough for folks to stomach.  <br/> <br/>Photographically.  -- The foreground is strong, but the sign taped to the wall should be in focus as well.  The DOF should be deep for this statement.  This is a powerful statement, but no one that many are comfortable addressing.  Good luck -- High marks.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to think or feel about this.  Is that good or bad?   It will be interesting to see what you were going for.  Racially motivated statements are tough for folks to stomach.   Photographically.  -- The foreground is strong, but the sign taped to the wall should be in focus as well.  The DOF should be deep for this statement.  This is a powerful statement, but no one that many are comfortable addressing.  Good luck -- High marks.', '2004-02-26 21:43:37.000000', NULL, 1);
