(600604, 62090, 6600, '<td valign="top">Kind of a High Key type of shot....  I like it!  May be considered a bit of a reach for conflict though.  Decent compositon, nice color.  Good job.</td>', 'Kind of a High Key type of shot....  I like it!  May be considered a bit of a reach for conflict though.  Decent compositon, nice color.  Good job.', '2004-02-26 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
