(600606, 61985, 6073, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the lighting equal on both left/right to score higher.<br/>Still very good</td>', 'I would like to see the lighting equal on both left/right to score higher.Still very good', '2004-02-26 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
