(600616, 61797, 6600, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from Cops.....  Dramatic photo!  Good job.  (I might have simply entitled it Distressed.</td>', 'Looks like a scene from Cops.....  Dramatic photo!  Good job.  (I might have simply entitled it Distressed.', '2004-02-26 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(600617, 61911, 15606, '<td valign="top">the flash is too harsh and directed - the strong shadows on the wall are distracting, and the face is too bright.  try some tissue paper over the flash to help diminish this.  also kind of a stretch for conflict, but I guess I can see it if you''ve forced the poor lil guy to smile :)</td>', 'the flash is too harsh and directed - the strong shadows on the wall are distracting, and the face is too bright.  try some tissue paper over the flash to help diminish this.  also kind of a stretch for conflict, but I guess I can see it if you''ve forced the poor lil guy to smile :)', '2004-02-26 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(600618, 61996, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat composition, like the idea, a reach for the challenge though.  Good job.</td>', 'Neat composition, like the idea, a reach for the challenge though.  Good job.', '2004-02-26 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(600619, 61710, 15606, '<td valign="top">nicely exposed, and I like the way their manes are flying</td>', 'nicely exposed, and I like the way their manes are flying', '2004-02-26 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(600620, 61802, 15606, '<td valign="top">eliminate flash or reduce via diffusion.</td>', 'eliminate flash or reduce via diffusion.', '2004-02-26 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(600622, 61360, 15606, '<td valign="top">now this is a good way to use those pesky over exposed shots!  j/k - this is actually kinda cool.  I think a little tighter crop might help, and a little less exposure time.</td>', 'now this is a good way to use those pesky over exposed shots!  j/k - this is actually kinda cool.  I think a little tighter crop might help, and a little less exposure time.', '2004-02-26 22:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(600624, 61183, 6600, '<td valign="top">Amazing color!  Good job.</td>', 'Amazing color!  Good job.', '2004-02-26 22:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(600625, 62160, 15606, '<td valign="top">oooh, kinda creepy.  the bible''s a wee bit crooked, and I think I would have liked less fuzz on the bottom.</td>', 'oooh, kinda creepy.  the bible''s a wee bit crooked, and I think I would have liked less fuzz on the bottom.', '2004-02-26 22:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(600626, 61775, 15606, '<td valign="top">nice light onthe wings</td>', 'nice light onthe wings', '2004-02-26 22:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(600628, 61798, 15606, '<td valign="top">you''ve been to my house!!! :)  cute.  high key would really do justice to these cute lil girls and their light clothes.</td>', 'you''ve been to my house!!! :)  cute.  high key would really do justice to these cute lil girls and their light clothes.', '2004-02-26 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(600629, 61787, 15606, '<td valign="top">I get more colic than conflict from this :)  Cute kiddo pic, though.</td>', 'I get more colic than conflict from this :)  Cute kiddo pic, though.', '2004-02-26 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(600631, 61343, 6600, '<td valign="top">Who nose how good this will do.  Certainly displays conflict.  Would have been better to have the head perfectly in focus with the hand slightly blurred (showing the motion).  Good job, good luck.</td>', 'Who nose how good this will do.  Certainly displays conflict.  Would have been better to have the head perfectly in focus with the hand slightly blurred (showing the motion).  Good job, good luck.', '2004-02-26 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(600632, 61920, 17801, '<td valign="top">This image shows a conflict between the Viewer / photographer and the subject.  The lower shutter speed, while keeping the head, body and water in focus, allows motion blur of the wings to show the aggressive nature of the defensive subject.  Good display for this category (score = 8)</td>', 'This image shows a conflict between the Viewer / photographer and the subject.  The lower shutter speed, while keeping the head, body and water in focus, allows motion blur of the wings to show the aggressive nature of the defensive subject.  Good display for this category (score = 8)', '2004-02-26 22:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(600634, 62088, 15606, '<td valign="top">isn''t denial the the avoidance of conflict?  anyway, I like the photo itself - especially the man''s eyes and cute messy hair.  I like that framing technique too - I might have to use that myself sometime.</td>', 'isn''t denial the the avoidance of conflict?  anyway, I like the photo itself - especially the man''s eyes and cute messy hair.  I like that framing technique too - I might have to use that myself sometime.', '2004-02-26 22:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(600635, 61985, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and tones, like the lighting as well.  Good job!  (chess pieces are certainly a popular subject on DPC).</td>', 'Nice textures and tones, like the lighting as well.  Good job!  (chess pieces are certainly a popular subject on DPC).', '2004-02-26 22:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(600636, 61845, 15606, '<td valign="top">oh GOD!  What to DO????  LOLOL   Funny idea.  A bit more contrast would spice it up a bit, I think.</td>', 'oh GOD!  What to DO????  LOLOL   Funny idea.  A bit more contrast would spice it up a bit, I think.', '2004-02-26 22:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
