(601185, 61797, 15606, '<td valign="top">very interesting image - the guy against the wall looks a little staged, but the other two look very natural.  I like the persperation (?) highlights on her face - it adds to the tense feeling of the image.  I''m not normally big on the reddish glow look, but for this image it works well.</td>', 'very interesting image - the guy against the wall looks a little staged, but the other two look very natural.  I like the persperation (?) highlights on her face - it adds to the tense feeling of the image.  I''m not normally big on the reddish glow look, but for this image it works well.', '2004-02-27 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(601188, 62120, 3697, '<td valign="top">Maybe the title of your pic was meant as humor, but telling people they are stupid if they vote a certain way probably won''t get you many high scores :) As for the picture, it''s a very interesting take on this week''s assignment.</td>', 'Maybe the title of your pic was meant as humor, but telling people they are stupid if they vote a certain way probably won''t get you many high scores :) As for the picture, it''s a very interesting take on this week''s assignment.', '2004-02-27 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
