(601191, 61989, 14897, '<td valign="top">Hey, it´s great, a kind of "voyeur" here. The woman out of focus, just passing, makes the scene even more interesting. The only thing I would do here is putting the couple a little bit more to the left to make the composition more  balanced. But still one of my three favorites, I hope this one gets a ribbon.</td>', 'Hey, it´s great, a kind of "voyeur" here. The woman out of focus, just passing, makes the scene even more interesting. The only thing I would do here is putting the couple a little bit more to the left to make the composition more  balanced. But still one of my three favorites, I hope this one gets a ribbon.', '2004-02-27 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(601192, 62143, 14897, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! When I first looked at his picture, i thought: "Hey, it´s a little bit under-exposed". But, after that, I realized that it is probably intentional - the under-exposition in the kid made the kid´s skin darker, and enhanced the "whites only" conflict. I hope this one gets the blue ribbon, it´s the best of all.</td>', 'Fantastic! When I first looked at his picture, i thought: "Hey, it´s a little bit under-exposed". But, after that, I realized that it is probably intentional - the under-exposition in the kid made the kid´s skin darker, and enhanced the "whites only" conflict. I hope this one gets the blue ribbon, it´s the best of all.', '2004-02-27 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(601194, 62120, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I don''t like the thing in the upper right, though, since it detracts from the summetry of the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice.  I don''t like the thing in the upper right, though, since it detracts from the summetry of the rest of the photo.', '2004-02-27 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
