(601263, 62114, 12151, '<td valign="top">Funny photo, and attractive technically.  My only problem with this photo relates to content.  If you''re actually just posing the question "Who''s right?" with this photo, the underlying assumption is that the two are in conflict.  Granted, that''s what many people believe, but others also don''t believe that there is a conflict between the two, kind of nulling the potential strength of this photo for those people.   I know you haven''t written an essay here, and you don''t have multiple photos to flesh out your subject matter, but this is just something to keep in mind.</td>', 'Funny photo, and attractive technically.  My only problem with this photo relates to content.  If you''re actually just posing the question "Who''s right?" with this photo, the underlying assumption is that the two are in conflict.  Granted, that''s what many people believe, but others also don''t believe that there is a conflict between the two, kind of nulling the potential strength of this photo for those people.   I know you haven''t written an essay here, and you don''t have multiple photos to flesh out your subject matter, but this is just something to keep in mind.', '2004-02-27 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
