(601405, 61683, 12475, '<td valign="top">Ha! Very appealing shot; I love her expression. It''s a little washed out color-wise and I might have cropped in more to the girl and fish; I don''t think the background adds much to the story here, and as is, the fish is a little hard to see.</td>', 'Ha! Very appealing shot; I love her expression. It''s a little washed out color-wise and I might have cropped in more to the girl and fish; I don''t think the background adds much to the story here, and as is, the fish is a little hard to see.', '2004-02-27 14:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(601406, 61882, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is interesting; moody and  a bit distubing. Good work.</td>', 'This is interesting; moody and  a bit distubing. Good work.', '2004-02-27 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(601408, 61556, 16777, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the idea, but it seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the idea, but it seems a little out of focus.', '2004-02-27 14:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
