(601457, 62000, 17375, '<td valign="top">Very well done...seems a little blurry...not sure if it was intended...but I do like the conflict involved in this photo...keep em coming.</td>', 'Very well done...seems a little blurry...not sure if it was intended...but I do like the conflict involved in this photo...keep em coming.', '2004-02-27 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
