(601459, 61588, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Why the icky heavy border, though? Anyway, I love this, even the red tinge--adds the right emotional tenor.</td>', 'Very cool shot! Why the icky heavy border, though? Anyway, I love this, even the red tinge--adds the right emotional tenor.', '2004-02-27 14:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
