(601463, 62136, 14773, '<td valign="top">With the deep shadowing it is a little bit hard to see what''s really going on here.  But I do like the concept, I would recommend [but what do i know? lol] some compositional changes.</td>', 'With the deep shadowing it is a little bit hard to see what''s really going on here.  But I do like the concept, I would recommend [but what do i know? lol] some compositional changes.', '2004-02-27 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
