(601469, 62167, 12475, '<td valign="top">Excellent!! This is my favorite for the challenge theme. (I would have toned down the title a bit--you don''t even need it, the picture tells everything.)</td>', 'Excellent!! This is my favorite for the challenge theme. (I would have toned down the title a bit--you don''t even need it, the picture tells everything.)', '2004-02-27 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
