(601513, 61996, 14773, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot quite a bit. I love the negative space and selective crop. I normally don''t like sexual images in regards to military, but here, it speaks volumes and serves the photo exceptionally well. Very nice composition. 8.</td>', 'I do like this shot quite a bit. I love the negative space and selective crop. I normally don''t like sexual images in regards to military, but here, it speaks volumes and serves the photo exceptionally well. Very nice composition. 8.', '2004-02-27 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(601514, 61594, 327, '<td valign="top">This could be titled.."strike a pose" It''s almost journalistic and has a good feel. I like the grain and tones. Not sure I see conflict, but it''s interesting.</td>', 'This could be titled.."strike a pose" It''s almost journalistic and has a good feel. I like the grain and tones. Not sure I see conflict, but it''s interesting.', '2004-02-27 15:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
