(601517, 62167, 327, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. I''m attracted to the colors and of course the stop action. Love the tats on the one girl.......wooh would love to see her in person and get a close up view of them.</td>', 'Very good shot. I''m attracted to the colors and of course the stop action. Love the tats on the one girl.......wooh would love to see her in person and get a close up view of them.', '2004-02-27 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
