(601529, 62143, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very emotional; there is a lot to like and admire in this shot. For me, the tones are too similar; I''d like to see more contrast. But I like this very much.</td>', 'Very emotional; there is a lot to like and admire in this shot. For me, the tones are too similar; I''d like to see more contrast. But I like this very much.', '2004-02-27 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
