(601536, 61757, 14773, '<td valign="top">love the idea of the spotlight, but the composition seems a litte poor, sorry! I think it comes from the lighting as a whole, it''s a bit weak. 4.</td>', 'love the idea of the spotlight, but the composition seems a litte poor, sorry! I think it comes from the lighting as a whole, it''s a bit weak. 4.', '2004-02-27 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
