(601540, 62006, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast, makes it seem like a charcoal drawing</td>', 'I like the high contrast, makes it seem like a charcoal drawing', '2004-02-27 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(601542, 61687, 14773, '<td valign="top">Don''t let conflicts constrict you.  I like the photograph, it doesn''t speak a conflict to me directly.. unless the dark area and shadowed face are meant to show his anguish and internal conflict? Ahhhh......</td>', 'Don''t let conflicts constrict you.  I like the photograph, it doesn''t speak a conflict to me directly.. unless the dark area and shadowed face are meant to show his anguish and internal conflict? Ahhhh......', '2004-02-27 15:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(601544, 61966, 14773, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS.  great photo, this is my top pic. 9  The blurred background fools you [well, me] into think it''s a real background, great color and DOF.</td>', 'I LOVE THIS.  great photo, this is my top pic. 9  The blurred background fools you [well, me] into think it''s a real background, great color and DOF.', '2004-02-27 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(601550, 62017, 14773, '<td valign="top">I see the conflict by the sword, but her body and expression don''t say anything to this affect to me, and the hair piece isn''t flattering [I know, that''s nit picking, but it stands out to me]. The lighting I do like alot and the BNW. 5.</td>', 'I see the conflict by the sword, but her body and expression don''t say anything to this affect to me, and the hair piece isn''t flattering [I know, that''s nit picking, but it stands out to me]. The lighting I do like alot and the BNW. 5.', '2004-02-27 16:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(601554, 61556, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find the water line very interesting in this shot.  The way the light is playing off the glass to make it almost look like there is another glass inside is very cool.  The exposure is good although the highlights are a little bright.  I like the choice of black and white and the grainyness/scratches and or bubbles on the glass.  However, I don''t think this conveys conflict very strongly although I do see the connection to conflicting states of mind.  This is a good example of a well centered shot with a reason behind it.  6</td>', 'I find the water line very interesting in this shot.  The way the light is playing off the glass to make it almost look like there is another glass inside is very cool.  The exposure is good although the highlights are a little bright.  I like the choice of black and white and the grainyness/scratches and or bubbles on the glass.  However, I don''t think this conveys conflict very strongly although I do see the connection to conflicting states of mind.  This is a good example of a well centered shot with a reason behind it.  6', '2004-02-27 16:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(601565, 62100, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find this image very odd.  Nothing seems to go together!  I guess that was your "conflict," but I don''t see exactly what two things I am supposed to be comparing to see who is winning.  I am feeling a bit dense at the moment.  Nature vs man, mother earth vs god, fractals vs straight lines,  blue vs hideous orange pink?  Something needs to be done about the blue cast...  My favorite thing about this image is what I think is a bird.  5</td>', 'I find this image very odd.  Nothing seems to go together!  I guess that was your "conflict," but I don''t see exactly what two things I am supposed to be comparing to see who is winning.  I am feeling a bit dense at the moment.  Nature vs man, mother earth vs god, fractals vs straight lines,  blue vs hideous orange pink?  Something needs to be done about the blue cast...  My favorite thing about this image is what I think is a bird.  5', '2004-02-27 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(601569, 61588, 10339, '<td valign="top">The border seems a little too large. I do like the magenta tones you have added.</td>', 'The border seems a little too large. I do like the magenta tones you have added.', '2004-02-27 16:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(601573, 61343, 6349, '<td valign="top">I find this image very funny and appealing.  It seems posed but that adds to the humor.  It has been neat-imaged a little too much in my opinion.  I''d crop it a little lower on the top to get rid of the piece of hair sticking down.  Effective for the challenge if not the most original idea... 6</td>', 'I find this image very funny and appealing.  It seems posed but that adds to the humor.  It has been neat-imaged a little too much in my opinion.  I''d crop it a little lower on the top to get rid of the piece of hair sticking down.  Effective for the challenge if not the most original idea... 6', '2004-02-27 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(601577, 62092, 6349, '<td valign="top">To open it or not to open it, huh.  Taking photos of your tv is not allowed!  Just kidding, I''ll assume you didn''t.  I really the idea, pose, and lighitng, but it suffers from being too out of focus and a bit too small.  Effective nonetheless.  6</td>', 'To open it or not to open it, huh.  Taking photos of your tv is not allowed!  Just kidding, I''ll assume you didn''t.  I really the idea, pose, and lighitng, but it suffers from being too out of focus and a bit too small.  Effective nonetheless.  6', '2004-02-27 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(601581, 62139, 6349, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this really shows conflict, although it is a well thought out bit of design.  Technically it could benefit from a lot of things.  The middle line should be straight, the points of the pencils should not overlap eachother, they should meet, and better lighting should be used to eliminate the shadow that you can only see on the white side.  I think this would also do better if you hadn''t rotated it.  4</td>', 'I don''t think this really shows conflict, although it is a well thought out bit of design.  Technically it could benefit from a lot of things.  The middle line should be straight, the points of the pencils should not overlap eachother, they should meet, and better lighting should be used to eliminate the shadow that you can only see on the white side.  I think this would also do better if you hadn''t rotated it.  4', '2004-02-27 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(601583, 62063, 6349, '<td valign="top">Georgeous shot (is that how you spell georgeous?)<br/>Anyway, this is wonderfully well composed and exposed.  The leading lines of the road and fence and layers of background mountains make this a top shot.  This probably won''t get the score it deserves because people are looking for more obvious physical or even emotional conflict, rather than conflict between elements of the photo.  That''s just my guess though and I hope I''m wrong.  9</td>', 'Georgeous shot (is that how you spell georgeous?)Anyway, this is wonderfully well composed and exposed.  The leading lines of the road and fence and layers of background mountains make this a top shot.  This probably won''t get the score it deserves because people are looking for more obvious physical or even emotional conflict, rather than conflict between elements of the photo.  That''s just my guess though and I hope I''m wrong.  9', '2004-02-27 16:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(601585, 62140, 10339, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2004-02-27 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(601590, 62158, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like that you can see the reflection in the balloon.  You spelled balloon wrong.  Good idea for the challenge.  It has an artistic minimalist feel to it. 7</td>', 'I like that you can see the reflection in the balloon.  You spelled balloon wrong.  Good idea for the challenge.  It has an artistic minimalist feel to it. 7', '2004-02-27 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(601592, 61979, 6349, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say conflict to me.  If anything it is the opposite, piecing back together.  It is, however, a powerful image.  I like the lighting and the composition.  5</td>', 'This doesn''t really say conflict to me.  If anything it is the opposite, piecing back together.  It is, however, a powerful image.  I like the lighting and the composition.  5', '2004-02-27 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(601595, 61685, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think the conflict is supposed to be people driving off the road and hitting and killing each other but it doesn''t look right.  Something is entirely wrong with this image I just can''t put my finger on what it is. 4</td>', 'I think the conflict is supposed to be people driving off the road and hitting and killing each other but it doesn''t look right.  Something is entirely wrong with this image I just can''t put my finger on what it is. 4', '2004-02-27 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(601596, 61691, 6349, '<td valign="top">The absolutely wonderful post processing you did on this image totally eliminated any sense of conflict that may have been visible in the expressions of the people.  To me it looks like a friendly scene that doesn''t fit the title.  The figures remind me of those in a painting.  I''m curious about what this scene really was and what the title means.  5</td>', 'The absolutely wonderful post processing you did on this image totally eliminated any sense of conflict that may have been visible in the expressions of the people.  To me it looks like a friendly scene that doesn''t fit the title.  The figures remind me of those in a painting.  I''m curious about what this scene really was and what the title means.  5', '2004-02-27 16:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(601600, 62109, 6349, '<td valign="top">You should have made little arms and legs and pictured them fighting.  I''ve seen this idea done a million times on here and all over the place.  I didn''t even like it the first time.  This isn''t artistic, creative, or even difficult to technically achieve.  3</td>', 'You should have made little arms and legs and pictured them fighting.  I''ve seen this idea done a million times on here and all over the place.  I didn''t even like it the first time.  This isn''t artistic, creative, or even difficult to technically achieve.  3', '2004-02-27 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(601605, 61952, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Finally someone with a good idea for the challenge and good execution!  The DOF is perfect.  Having the bills in the background pull the "conflict" theme more into the photo where it might have been lacking with the cutting of the card alone, but having them out of focus prevents them from distracting with the actual physical conflict and focal point of the image.  My favorite so far.  10</td>', 'Very nice!  Finally someone with a good idea for the challenge and good execution!  The DOF is perfect.  Having the bills in the background pull the "conflict" theme more into the photo where it might have been lacking with the cutting of the card alone, but having them out of focus prevents them from distracting with the actual physical conflict and focal point of the image.  My favorite so far.  10', '2004-02-27 16:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(601608, 62147, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Conflict is very obvious and also meaningful to the shot.  I like your toning levels and grain.  8</td>', 'Very nice.  Conflict is very obvious and also meaningful to the shot.  I like your toning levels and grain.  8', '2004-02-27 16:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(601610, 61797, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I get the immediate impression of the fear of the girl running from the scene of a crime.  I like that the emotion element is stressed over the physical violence by the narrow DOF.  7</td>', 'Very well done.  I get the immediate impression of the fear of the girl running from the scene of a crime.  I like that the emotion element is stressed over the physical violence by the narrow DOF.  7', '2004-02-27 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(601613, 61976, 6349, '<td valign="top">You should have chosen something more interesting for the background.  Otherwise a good idea and well executed. 6</td>', 'You should have chosen something more interesting for the background.  Otherwise a good idea and well executed. 6', '2004-02-27 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(601616, 61869, 6349, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Perhaps this could use a slightly better composition as the eye is not drawn to any specific area.  It is lead off the page by the bottle.  I think you wanted the eye to find the word drunkeness, but I''m sure most people won''t look at it long enough to find it.  I think it''s funny that it comes right after orgies... 5</td>', 'Good idea.  Perhaps this could use a slightly better composition as the eye is not drawn to any specific area.  It is lead off the page by the bottle.  I think you wanted the eye to find the word drunkeness, but I''m sure most people won''t look at it long enough to find it.  I think it''s funny that it comes right after orgies... 5', '2004-02-27 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(601618, 61921, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Unattractive photo though.  The composition is unbalanced and just rather boring.  4</td>', 'Nice capture.  Unattractive photo though.  The composition is unbalanced and just rather boring.  4', '2004-02-27 16:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(601620, 62158, 17612, '<td valign="top">I like the effective colors. A glint of light on the knive would have been "sharp".</td>', 'I like the effective colors. A glint of light on the knive would have been "sharp".', '2004-02-27 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(601621, 61911, 6349, '<td valign="top">There is no conflict here whatsoever.  Perhaps it was supposed to be that the kid didn''t want to smile so he was making a false smile?  Either way, it really isn''t apparent at all and the flash used really detracts from the quality of the portrait. 3</td>', 'There is no conflict here whatsoever.  Perhaps it was supposed to be that the kid didn''t want to smile so he was making a false smile?  Either way, it really isn''t apparent at all and the flash used really detracts from the quality of the portrait. 3', '2004-02-27 16:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(601623, 61953, 6349, '<td valign="top">The blood in the water is creepy.  This is a good shot, but I don''t really see any conflict in it without the title.  It just a canadian goose, some icey water, rocks, and what appears to be blood.  With your title added I think maybe the other goose has been shot and killed, which just makes this rather, well, creepy.  Luckily, I like creepy...7</td>', 'The blood in the water is creepy.  This is a good shot, but I don''t really see any conflict in it without the title.  It just a canadian goose, some icey water, rocks, and what appears to be blood.  With your title added I think maybe the other goose has been shot and killed, which just makes this rather, well, creepy.  Luckily, I like creepy...7', '2004-02-27 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(601624, 61916, 6349, '<td valign="top">Why what?  We have no idea what is going on here.  Decent snapshot of a kid sitting in the snow though. 4</td>', 'Why what?  We have no idea what is going on here.  Decent snapshot of a kid sitting in the snow though. 4', '2004-02-27 16:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(601627, 62065, 6349, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is a LAMB.  Is this about the manger and jesus and the passion?  is this about people being sheep, followers of the flock, lambs to the slaugher?  is that where the conflict is?  What comes to mind when different people see this?  Not a very good photograph.  It looks like a quick snapshot with really no thought given to the angle or the idea.  Plus, it''s too small.  3</td>', 'Yes, it is a LAMB.  Is this about the manger and jesus and the passion?  is this about people being sheep, followers of the flock, lambs to the slaugher?  is that where the conflict is?  What comes to mind when different people see this?  Not a very good photograph.  It looks like a quick snapshot with really no thought given to the angle or the idea.  Plus, it''s too small.  3', '2004-02-27 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(601628, 61171, 6349, '<td valign="top">Neat image completely RUINED what appears to be a fine photograph.  The border doesn''t help either.  5</td>', 'Neat image completely RUINED what appears to be a fine photograph.  The border doesn''t help either.  5', '2004-02-27 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(601629, 62124, 17612, '<td valign="top">Similar idea to my own Faux Pas! By the way the light on the plate gives it an optical illusion. ie: is the plate unside down?</td>', 'Similar idea to my own Faux Pas! By the way the light on the plate gives it an optical illusion. ie: is the plate unside down?', '2004-02-27 16:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(601632, 61599, 6349, '<td valign="top">haha.  that''s funny.  This was a good idea that could benefit from a better lighting set up.  I would try for a shot without the hair in the top and the ear as well.  At least if you''re going to keep the one ear, keep the whole ear, and let the other person have at least one ear too so they can have two ears between them.  :)  5</td>', 'haha.  that''s funny.  This was a good idea that could benefit from a better lighting set up.  I would try for a shot without the hair in the top and the ear as well.  At least if you''re going to keep the one ear, keep the whole ear, and let the other person have at least one ear too so they can have two ears between them.  :)  5', '2004-02-27 16:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(601635, 61812, 6349, '<td valign="top">This photo would be more interesting to me if it didn''t look like they were fighting over a rotten banana.  The emotion and the capture of the scene is very good.  It is well exposed, sharp, and a good choice for black and white.  7</td>', 'This photo would be more interesting to me if it didn''t look like they were fighting over a rotten banana.  The emotion and the capture of the scene is very good.  It is well exposed, sharp, and a good choice for black and white.  7', '2004-02-27 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
