(601645, 61319, 6349, '<td valign="top">Well captured scene.  The position of the canon and the tree are excellent.  The only thing slightly distracting is the fact that the right wheel has essentially become just a straight line which sort of seperates the image awkwardly.  If it is possible in the scene to move yourself slightly to the left to eliminate this while still keeping the rest of the composition how you have it I would recommend trying that.  9</td>', 'Well captured scene.  The position of the canon and the tree are excellent.  The only thing slightly distracting is the fact that the right wheel has essentially become just a straight line which sort of seperates the image awkwardly.  If it is possible in the scene to move yourself slightly to the left to eliminate this while still keeping the rest of the composition how you have it I would recommend trying that.  9', '2004-02-27 16:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
