(601987, 61988, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, although I''m not crazy about the format and think a closer crop on the heads would make for greater impact.  I don''t like the sepia toning and it appears that subject movement could be the cause of the soft focus. That could have been improved with faster shutter speed if your camera is capable.  Yet, I really LOVE this picture with its flaws.  8</td>', 'Wonderful composition, although I''m not crazy about the format and think a closer crop on the heads would make for greater impact.  I don''t like the sepia toning and it appears that subject movement could be the cause of the soft focus. That could have been improved with faster shutter speed if your camera is capable.  Yet, I really LOVE this picture with its flaws.  8', '2004-02-27 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
