(601995, 61879, 13610, '<td valign="top">Not enough DOF there are flower that are out of focus.  If the DOF would have been more shallow (isolate a single flower for example) or less shallow, (all the plant crisp clear in the foreground with the machine blurry in the background), it would have been a really great Shllow DOF entry. Unfortunately this is a conflict challenge and i just don''t see a conflict. (4)</td>', 'Not enough DOF there are flower that are out of focus.  If the DOF would have been more shallow (isolate a single flower for example) or less shallow, (all the plant crisp clear in the foreground with the machine blurry in the background), it would have been a really great Shllow DOF entry. Unfortunately this is a conflict challenge and i just don''t see a conflict. (4)', '2004-02-27 22:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(601999, 62055, 13610, '<td valign="top">The idea here is great. Good B&amp;W treatment. i like the contrast you put in the picture. Maybe a little less grain, (or lot less grain) would have made a better shot. I know that some people like grain and add it after the shot was taken but i''m not into it. Good shot anyway. (6)</td>', 'The idea here is great. Good B&W treatment. i like the contrast you put in the picture. Maybe a little less grain, (or lot less grain) would have made a better shot. I know that some people like grain and add it after the shot was taken but i''m not into it. Good shot anyway. (6)', '2004-02-27 22:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(602003, 61964, 13610, '<td valign="top">I really like your pic, I mean it. I just dont get the conflict here. (6)</td>', 'I really like your pic, I mean it. I just dont get the conflict here. (6)', '2004-02-27 23:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(602007, 62005, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and very interesting shot.  Foreground rock is too dark and I don''t find toning to be very pleasing although I like the blue cast.  Horizon is tilted and the spray hitting the gulls is too blurred and seems to stop above the level of the rocks, as if you caught it at it''s tail end.  I think you could have also cropped out the top inch so as to eliminate a good part of the background. Still, I like very much.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and very interesting shot.  Foreground rock is too dark and I don''t find toning to be very pleasing although I like the blue cast.  Horizon is tilted and the spray hitting the gulls is too blurred and seems to stop above the level of the rocks, as if you caught it at it''s tail end.  I think you could have also cropped out the top inch so as to eliminate a good part of the background. Still, I like very much.', '2004-02-27 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(602012, 61802, 6667, '<td valign="top">Too close to your backdrop.  Over exposed.</td>', 'Too close to your backdrop.  Over exposed.', '2004-02-27 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
