(602196, 61691, 17644, '<td valign="top">i don''t see the conflict</td>', 'i don''t see the conflict', '2004-02-28 04:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(602201, 62129, 9075, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, could have been implemented a little better though.</td>', 'I love the concept, could have been implemented a little better though.', '2004-02-28 06:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(602252, 61582, 179, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. Depicts the challenge very well. The only problem I have with this is the placement within the frame. I would have liked to have seen less of the top and a little more of the lionesse on the lower right side. Colors are nicely balanced. Score: 7 Very well done! Good luck!</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. Depicts the challenge very well. The only problem I have with this is the placement within the frame. I would have liked to have seen less of the top and a little more of the lionesse on the lower right side. Colors are nicely balanced. Score: 7 Very well done! Good luck!', '2004-02-28 08:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(602255, 61475, 179, '<td valign="top">This is an " either you love it or hate it" shot... And I`m just in love with it. Original, depicts the chellenge to a "T". Color and lighting just come together brilliantly to create an artistic photo. I''m sorry to say I have nothing constructive to say about this shot, when it''s good it''s good! Score: 10 Awesome Job! Good luck!</td>', 'This is an " either you love it or hate it" shot... And I`m just in love with it. Original, depicts the chellenge to a "T". Color and lighting just come together brilliantly to create an artistic photo. I''m sorry to say I have nothing constructive to say about this shot, when it''s good it''s good! Score: 10 Awesome Job! Good luck!', '2004-02-28 08:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(602261, 61687, 179, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing some people won''t "get" this photo. Personally I find it very well thought of and extremly original. A piece of art that could have been taken from an old 50''s movie. My only knitpick about it is the lighting is a tad harsh on the face, but even that is streaching it. Score: 9 Nicely done! Good luck!</td>', 'I''m guessing some people won''t "get" this photo. Personally I find it very well thought of and extremly original. A piece of art that could have been taken from an old 50''s movie. My only knitpick about it is the lighting is a tad harsh on the face, but even that is streaching it. Score: 9 Nicely done! Good luck!', '2004-02-28 08:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(602270, 61929, 6458, '<td valign="top">Great pic John. 10 ;)</td>', 'Great pic John. 10 ;)', '2004-02-28 09:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(602271, 61714, 179, '<td valign="top">Usually, I don''t score too high a photo that can''t stand on it''s own without the title. But this one just cracks me up! It''s a great shot and the title just ads to it. One of those "turn that frown upside down" shots. Thanks for making my day! Score: 8 Great job and good luck!</td>', 'Usually, I don''t score too high a photo that can''t stand on it''s own without the title. But this one just cracks me up! It''s a great shot and the title just ads to it. One of those "turn that frown upside down" shots. Thanks for making my day! Score: 8 Great job and good luck!', '2004-02-28 09:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(602282, 61769, 179, '<td valign="top">I think that this was a nice idea to begin with. What doesn''t do it for me is this: <br/> <br/>- the placement within the frame. Photo is cropped a little tight. The offset placement of the cameras is too subtle for me. I would have liked no offset at all or a bolder one.<br/> <br/>-The shot is a little grainy, maybe not enough light for the ISO used. Unless that''s what you were going for. If so, again too subtle, bold or nothing.<br/> <br/>-The camera straps are distracting.<br/> <br/>However, the subject depicts the challenge quite well, and the contrast is nicely done. Score: 5 Good job nontheless! Good Luck!<br/></td>', 'I think that this was a nice idea to begin with. What doesn''t do it for me is this:  - the placement within the frame. Photo is cropped a little tight. The offset placement of the cameras is too subtle for me. I would have liked no offset at all or a bolder one. -The shot is a little grainy, maybe not enough light for the ISO used. Unless that''s what you were going for. If so, again too subtle, bold or nothing. -The camera straps are distracting. However, the subject depicts the challenge quite well, and the contrast is nicely done. Score: 5 Good job nontheless! Good Luck!', '2004-02-28 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(602283, 61865, 179, '<td valign="top">A really great idea. Original and a great depiction of the challenge. The only thing that bothers me in this shot is the frame at the top right. It''s a bit distracting. Score: 7 Nice job. Good luck!</td>', 'A really great idea. Original and a great depiction of the challenge. The only thing that bothers me in this shot is the frame at the top right. It''s a bit distracting. Score: 7 Nice job. Good luck!', '2004-02-28 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(602287, 62149, 179, '<td valign="top">A really nice idea for this challenge. Original and well excuted. The only distracting thing about it is the various little specs on the glasses and table. I would have rated this higher if it had been cleaned up in post processing.<br/>Score: 7 Nicely done! Good luck!</td>', 'A really nice idea for this challenge. Original and well excuted. The only distracting thing about it is the various little specs on the glasses and table. I would have rated this higher if it had been cleaned up in post processing.Score: 7 Nicely done! Good luck!', '2004-02-28 09:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(602289, 61716, 17776, '<td valign="top">Wow great picture, the concept is right on the mark and the flash gives a great effect.</td>', 'Wow great picture, the concept is right on the mark and the flash gives a great effect.', '2004-02-28 09:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(602291, 61183, 17776, '<td valign="top">How is this conflict? Just wondering, but really nice photo</td>', 'How is this conflict? Just wondering, but really nice photo', '2004-02-28 09:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(602293, 61229, 179, '<td valign="top">On it''s own, I really enjoy this shot. Composition is nice, DoF is well executed, sharpeness is near perfect and the lghting, although maybe a little harsh on some areas, is pretty good. However, for me it doesn''t depict the challenge. I don''t see the conflict in this shot. I would like to score this high but because of that I''ve given it a 4. An overall excellent shot just maybe not for this challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'On it''s own, I really enjoy this shot. Composition is nice, DoF is well executed, sharpeness is near perfect and the lghting, although maybe a little harsh on some areas, is pretty good. However, for me it doesn''t depict the challenge. I don''t see the conflict in this shot. I would like to score this high but because of that I''ve given it a 4. An overall excellent shot just maybe not for this challenge. Good luck!', '2004-02-28 09:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(602298, 61171, 13937, '<td valign="top">Extreme emotional content with great lighting.  Excellent portrait!</td>', 'Extreme emotional content with great lighting.  Excellent portrait!', '2004-02-28 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
