(602580, 62150, 13669, '<td valign="top">not enough dof for me...... for this type of shot, id much rather have just one focus point like the cannon, or have most the soldiers in front have focus.  but thats just me, other than that, nice use of colours.</td>', 'not enough dof for me...... for this type of shot, id much rather have just one focus point like the cannon, or have most the soldiers in front have focus.  but thats just me, other than that, nice use of colours.', '2004-02-28 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(602581, 61691, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m very interested in seeing the technical details for this when the challenge is over.  It''s a great shot - the high contrast and use of defocus on the subjects really adds drama.  Not sure how it will actually do here at dpc, being a bit outside of the box, but it''s an easy 9 from me.</td>', 'I''m very interested in seeing the technical details for this when the challenge is over.  It''s a great shot - the high contrast and use of defocus on the subjects really adds drama.  Not sure how it will actually do here at dpc, being a bit outside of the box, but it''s an easy 9 from me.', '2004-02-28 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(602582, 61921, 13669, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, for some reason, the water drop really bothers me.  Perhaps it would have been neater if the water drop splashed on to the fire.</td>', 'Nice effect, for some reason, the water drop really bothers me.  Perhaps it would have been neater if the water drop splashed on to the fire.', '2004-02-28 13:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
