(602587, 62167, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots of the challenge!  Shows genuine conflict, and I love the sharpness contrasted with the genuine motion blur.  Great saturated colors, composition and perfect timing, also.  10</td>', 'One of the best shots of the challenge!  Shows genuine conflict, and I love the sharpness contrasted with the genuine motion blur.  Great saturated colors, composition and perfect timing, also.  10', '2004-02-28 13:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
