(602618, 61475, 14511, '<td valign="top">Intense image! I think off-center cropping would make it even stronger.</td>', 'Intense image! I think off-center cropping would make it even stronger.', '2004-02-28 13:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(602627, 62143, 14511, '<td valign="top">Good concept. And bravo to the spirit represented by the young man! I think the image could use more contrast--it would make it more "in your face." The low contrast keeps it at a distance. Overall--well done!</td>', 'Good concept. And bravo to the spirit represented by the young man! I think the image could use more contrast--it would make it more "in your face." The low contrast keeps it at a distance. Overall--well done!', '2004-02-28 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(602632, 61517, 17720, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot - good use of color and contrast - almost surreal.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot - good use of color and contrast - almost surreal.', '2004-02-28 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(602638, 61691, 14511, '<td valign="top">I like this technique. C''mon--give up the secret! I like the implied conflict between the two groups. The pure white background both highlights and isolates the figures. Good work.</td>', 'I like this technique. C''mon--give up the secret! I like the implied conflict between the two groups. The pure white background both highlights and isolates the figures. Good work.', '2004-02-28 13:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(602648, 61932, 14511, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Great technique. But what''s the conflict? Staying in the egg vs. getting out? Conflict with the other eggs? Good photo skills. Keep shooting.</td>', 'Nice image. Great technique. But what''s the conflict? Staying in the egg vs. getting out? Conflict with the other eggs? Good photo skills. Keep shooting.', '2004-02-28 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(602658, 61952, 14511, '<td valign="top">Too many of us have this conflict. Good use of B&amp;W, depth of field. Good composition.</td>', 'Too many of us have this conflict. Good use of B&W, depth of field. Good composition.', '2004-02-28 13:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(602670, 62079, 14511, '<td valign="top">Silk and thorn is really more of a contrast than a conflict, isn''t it? Flower exposure is good, but most of the rest is too dark. Composition is pretty good; the yellow flowers capture your eye, and lead you down to the thorns (aloe?).</td>', 'Silk and thorn is really more of a contrast than a conflict, isn''t it? Flower exposure is good, but most of the rest is too dark. Composition is pretty good; the yellow flowers capture your eye, and lead you down to the thorns (aloe?).', '2004-02-28 13:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(602674, 62108, 14511, '<td valign="top">Grim. But art isn''t always pretty. I like the way you exposed this. Gritty.</td>', 'Grim. But art isn''t always pretty. I like the way you exposed this. Gritty.', '2004-02-28 14:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(602676, 61588, 14511, '<td valign="top">Cute. Right place at the right time. The red sets an appropriate mood.</td>', 'Cute. Right place at the right time. The red sets an appropriate mood.', '2004-02-28 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(602677, 61183, 14511, '<td valign="top">Technically good, but where is the conflict?</td>', 'Technically good, but where is the conflict?', '2004-02-28 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(602715, 61797, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there''s really no element in focus. Had the foreground girl been in sharp focus, this would have been far better.</td>', 'Good idea, but there''s really no element in focus. Had the foreground girl been in sharp focus, this would have been far better.', '2004-02-28 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(602730, 61879, 17203, '<td valign="top">I think I see where you''re going with this, but you''d pretty much have to have a clear-cut area with stumps and trees to pull it off. Even a gray squirrel or some other wildlife would have helped.</td>', 'I think I see where you''re going with this, but you''d pretty much have to have a clear-cut area with stumps and trees to pull it off. Even a gray squirrel or some other wildlife would have helped.', '2004-02-28 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(602735, 61229, 17203, '<td valign="top">Now put a cat in the background and you''ve got a conflict! Without that, I''m lost.</td>', 'Now put a cat in the background and you''ve got a conflict! Without that, I''m lost.', '2004-02-28 14:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(602740, 62090, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot- worth framing, but you''re taste is you own undoing here. I think these colors work quite nicely together, so the Conflict is weak. Maybe a green and red mixing to form an ugly color? Save these props for a Color challenge!   ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot- worth framing, but you''re taste is you own undoing here. I think these colors work quite nicely together, so the Conflict is weak. Maybe a green and red mixing to form an ugly color? Save these props for a Color challenge!   ;-)', '2004-02-28 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(602748, 61791, 17203, '<td valign="top">Too hard to make out a car- it just comes across as garbage to me. Pull back a little or show a steering wheel and you''ve got it.</td>', 'Too hard to make out a car- it just comes across as garbage to me. Pull back a little or show a steering wheel and you''ve got it.', '2004-02-28 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(602755, 62086, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and good tone. The foreground hand is a little too relaxed, though- that one looks more like a handshake than any actual struggle. Still, one of the best entries.</td>', 'Nicely done and good tone. The foreground hand is a little too relaxed, though- that one looks more like a handshake than any actual struggle. Still, one of the best entries.', '2004-02-28 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(602763, 61976, 17203, '<td valign="top">I actually shot this same scene with a different image on the TV (couldn''t get a satisfactory light on the hands), so obviously I think it''s a good concept. The message of unity on the screen directly contradicts your theme, though. Good work.</td>', 'I actually shot this same scene with a different image on the TV (couldn''t get a satisfactory light on the hands), so obviously I think it''s a good concept. The message of unity on the screen directly contradicts your theme, though. Good work.', '2004-02-28 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
