(602779, 62143, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of my top four from this challenge.  Easily the most powerful, realistic depiction of classic conflict out of all 200+ photos.  Well composed, very dramatic and full of feeling.  Photographically, I wish the whole image was perhaps exposed another 1/3 of a stop to bring out more detial in the boy''s face, but that''s very minor in this powerful image.  Well done!</td>', 'One of my top four from this challenge.  Easily the most powerful, realistic depiction of classic conflict out of all 200+ photos.  Well composed, very dramatic and full of feeling.  Photographically, I wish the whole image was perhaps exposed another 1/3 of a stop to bring out more detial in the boy''s face, but that''s very minor in this powerful image.  Well done!', '2004-02-28 14:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(602780, 61609, 17854, '<td valign="top">Great action shot</td>', 'Great action shot', '2004-02-28 14:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(602781, 61651, 5391, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge and very nicely composed.  My eye is wishing it were perhaps just a tiny touch sharper, but overall one of the better shots of the challenge.  8</td>', 'Good take on the challenge and very nicely composed.  My eye is wishing it were perhaps just a tiny touch sharper, but overall one of the better shots of the challenge.  8', '2004-02-28 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
