(603304, 61410, 4767, '<td valign="top">Thinks: "Mmmmmm which shall I eat first?  That cake is calling my name, but I do love those foil wrapped mints.  And wait, those cookies need chocolate milk to be dunked in..."  THAT is the conflict, right???  :)</td>', 'Thinks: "Mmmmmm which shall I eat first?  That cake is calling my name, but I do love those foil wrapped mints.  And wait, those cookies need chocolate milk to be dunked in..."  THAT is the conflict, right???  :)', '2004-02-29 02:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
