(603306, 62040, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is quite busy.  I discovered when I shot my Propaganda shot, that you have to try and figure out if every element in the shot is really necesary for the shot to work.  I think that you have issues like that here.  Did you need all that film AND all the developed negatives?  Or all the differing types of digital media...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is quite busy.  I discovered when I shot my Propaganda shot, that you have to try and figure out if every element in the shot is really necesary for the shot to work.  I think that you have issues like that here.  Did you need all that film AND all the developed negatives?  Or all the differing types of digital media...TC', '2004-02-29 03:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(603314, 61171, 9906, '<td valign="top">Ya got me right up to the edge of your overbearing border, then you lose me.  Damn, nice shot otherwise.  I just keep getting pulled to the border...<br/>TC</td>', 'Ya got me right up to the edge of your overbearing border, then you lose me.  Damn, nice shot otherwise.  I just keep getting pulled to the border...TC', '2004-02-29 04:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
