(604469, 61343, 14511, '<td valign="top">Good choice to isolate the subject against a solid, dark background. Just enough blur to suggest the movement. Good job.</td>', 'Good choice to isolate the subject against a solid, dark background. Just enough blur to suggest the movement. Good job.', '2004-03-01 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(604471, 61919, 14511, '<td valign="top">Pun intended, eh? I hate commuting.</td>', 'Pun intended, eh? I hate commuting.', '2004-03-01 12:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(604473, 62147, 14511, '<td valign="top">I like the monotones here, and the choice of background. Nice texture.</td>', 'I like the monotones here, and the choice of background. Nice texture.', '2004-03-01 12:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(604474, 61948, 14511, '<td valign="top">Where''s the conflict? Beauty struggles to be seen in the darkness?</td>', 'Where''s the conflict? Beauty struggles to be seen in the darkness?', '2004-03-01 12:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(604475, 61921, 14511, '<td valign="top">You have a quick shutter finger. Good catch. Good isolation and highlight of subjects. Portrait orientation, showing more of the ice, would be nice.</td>', 'You have a quick shutter finger. Good catch. Good isolation and highlight of subjects. Portrait orientation, showing more of the ice, would be nice.', '2004-03-01 12:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(604478, 62128, 14511, '<td valign="top">Inspired idea. Good representation of conflict.</td>', 'Inspired idea. Good representation of conflict.', '2004-03-01 12:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(604479, 61911, 14511, '<td valign="top">This is more "reluctance" than conflict, isn''t it?</td>', 'This is more "reluctance" than conflict, isn''t it?', '2004-03-01 12:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(604481, 61939, 14511, '<td valign="top">Not much real conflict, is there? The phone doesn''t care if it works or not. This is closer to "frustration."</td>', 'Not much real conflict, is there? The phone doesn''t care if it works or not. This is closer to "frustration."', '2004-03-01 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(604482, 61352, 14511, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but too static.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but too static.', '2004-03-01 12:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(604483, 62112, 14511, '<td valign="top">You said it yourself. This is "puzzled," not conflict.</td>', 'You said it yourself. This is "puzzled," not conflict.', '2004-03-01 12:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(604488, 62092, 14511, '<td valign="top">You took a picture of the TV screen?</td>', 'You took a picture of the TV screen?', '2004-03-01 12:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(604490, 61651, 14511, '<td valign="top">That''s a man that *wants* to get caught!</td>', 'That''s a man that *wants* to get caught!', '2004-03-01 12:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(604492, 61989, 14511, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but I think tighter cropping would make it more powerful. Crop just to the left of her back, giving her nowhere to go.</td>', 'Not bad, but I think tighter cropping would make it more powerful. Crop just to the left of her back, giving her nowhere to go.', '2004-03-01 12:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(604493, 61709, 14511, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but too static to really show the intended conflict.</td>', 'Cool idea, but too static to really show the intended conflict.', '2004-03-01 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(604497, 61744, 14511, '<td valign="top">Who is he giving the warning to? And how do we know? It looks like he''s just sitting there. Not bad technically, but doesn''t really show conflict.</td>', 'Who is he giving the warning to? And how do we know? It looks like he''s just sitting there. Not bad technically, but doesn''t really show conflict.', '2004-03-01 12:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(604499, 61879, 14511, '<td valign="top">We know who''s going to win this conflict.</td>', 'We know who''s going to win this conflict.', '2004-03-01 12:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(604501, 62149, 14511, '<td valign="top">No conflict here . . . oil beats water every time. Or are the two glasses racing? Kinda confusing. Good, sharp exposure, though.</td>', 'No conflict here . . . oil beats water every time. Or are the two glasses racing? Kinda confusing. Good, sharp exposure, though.', '2004-03-01 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(604502, 62164, 14511, '<td valign="top">Is there really a conflict between buffalo and modern cattle? Or is this contrast?</td>', 'Is there really a conflict between buffalo and modern cattle? Or is this contrast?', '2004-03-01 12:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(604505, 61862, 14511, '<td valign="top">Looks like a product shot. I mean that in a good way. These are hard to do. A little hot on the left side of the ice cream, but a pretty good composition and exposure job.</td>', 'Looks like a product shot. I mean that in a good way. These are hard to do. A little hot on the left side of the ice cream, but a pretty good composition and exposure job.', '2004-03-01 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(604507, 62114, 14511, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Certainly a lot of conflict in what this represents.</td>', 'Cool idea. Certainly a lot of conflict in what this represents.', '2004-03-01 12:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(604510, 61504, 14511, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and exposure here. But as you can see from the other rock-paper-scissors entries, a little too on-the-nose. (Too obvious, trite, common.)</td>', 'I like the composition and exposure here. But as you can see from the other rock-paper-scissors entries, a little too on-the-nose. (Too obvious, trite, common.)', '2004-03-01 12:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(604513, 62103, 14511, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of portrait orientation. It shows him in a dark hole, looking into a short, dark future. I do hope this is an actor portrayal. ;-)</td>', 'I like your choice of portrait orientation. It shows him in a dark hole, looking into a short, dark future. I do hope this is an actor portrayal. ;-)', '2004-03-01 12:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(604518, 61462, 14511, '<td valign="top">That''s a huge conflict. I think you could have gotten in tighter on the graffiti. The railing and shadows seem to distract a bit. But then again, the railing isn''t bad. Guess I just don''t like the shadows. But overall, not bad.</td>', 'That''s a huge conflict. I think you could have gotten in tighter on the graffiti. The railing and shadows seem to distract a bit. But then again, the railing isn''t bad. Guess I just don''t like the shadows. But overall, not bad.', '2004-03-01 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(604521, 61966, 14511, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but how about placing the guys so it''s a direct face-off? I think that would be stronger. Background light (fire?) is good.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but how about placing the guys so it''s a direct face-off? I think that would be stronger. Background light (fire?) is good.', '2004-03-01 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(604522, 61929, 14511, '<td valign="top">Is he supposed to be staring down an enemy or challenger? Pretty good shot of this guy, but where''s the conflict?</td>', 'Is he supposed to be staring down an enemy or challenger? Pretty good shot of this guy, but where''s the conflict?', '2004-03-01 12:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(604527, 61797, 14511, '<td valign="top">Glad I don''t live in this neighborhood. Good setup here. I like the composition, the night lighting. Actors? Let''s hope so! Good placement of the woman just exiting the frame.</td>', 'Glad I don''t live in this neighborhood. Good setup here. I like the composition, the night lighting. Actors? Let''s hope so! Good placement of the woman just exiting the frame.', '2004-03-01 12:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(604528, 61229, 14511, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of a sparrow, but where is the conflict?</td>', 'Nice picture of a sparrow, but where is the conflict?', '2004-03-01 12:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(604533, 62081, 14511, '<td valign="top">Good shot of a wolf, but I don''t think an entry should depend on it''s title to indicate conflict. This guy could be standing there very happy and content. But you did nail the shot.</td>', 'Good shot of a wolf, but I don''t think an entry should depend on it''s title to indicate conflict. This guy could be standing there very happy and content. But you did nail the shot.', '2004-03-01 12:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(604534, 61599, 14511, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2004-03-01 12:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
