(605078, 61871, 12448, '<td valign="top">A battle of the minds, very well done.  Excellent DOF on this shot, the lighting is well done.  The one right corner is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  A 7</td>', 'A battle of the minds, very well done.  Excellent DOF on this shot, the lighting is well done.  The one right corner is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  A 7', '2004-03-01 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(605082, 61864, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, seagulls can be very feisty when fighting for food can''t they?  Finding Nemo hit it on the head with, "MINE?  MINE?  MINE?" :)<br/> <br/>Nice cropping, nice light, the tree branches are a bit distracting to me but overall not a bad shot.  A 7</td>', 'Nice action shot, seagulls can be very feisty when fighting for food can''t they?  Finding Nemo hit it on the head with, "MINE?  MINE?  MINE?" :) Nice cropping, nice light, the tree branches are a bit distracting to me but overall not a bad shot.  A 7', '2004-03-01 19:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(605084, 61914, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not really :)  A nice idea but doesn''t really speak conflict to me.  Perhaps if you had a chick to go with the egg it would be a classic conflict of who came first.  Also the table is a bit distracting to this shot, a more solid backdrop would really make this work for me plus a touch more contrast.  A 4</td>', 'Not really :)  A nice idea but doesn''t really speak conflict to me.  Perhaps if you had a chick to go with the egg it would be a classic conflict of who came first.  Also the table is a bit distracting to this shot, a more solid backdrop would really make this work for me plus a touch more contrast.  A 4', '2004-03-01 19:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(605086, 61456, 12448, '<td valign="top">AT least this time of year you know who wins, LOL!  Come November it will be the other way around if you are in the Northern Hemisphere.  <br/> <br/>A nice shot, the branches leading you in and out of the shot, the solid black ground is very nice.  The border is a bit much maybe just a bit smaller?  An 8</td>', 'AT least this time of year you know who wins, LOL!  Come November it will be the other way around if you are in the Northern Hemisphere.   A nice shot, the branches leading you in and out of the shot, the solid black ground is very nice.  The border is a bit much maybe just a bit smaller?  An 8', '2004-03-01 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(605089, 61482, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Now, what are they fighting over? :)<br/> <br/>Excellent colors, wonderful expressions, nice lighting and the cropping is close to perfect.  A 9</td>', 'Very nice!  Now, what are they fighting over? :) Excellent colors, wonderful expressions, nice lighting and the cropping is close to perfect.  A 9', '2004-03-01 20:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(605181, 62140, 10818, '<td valign="top">Ouch.......you opened that up pretty good.<br/> <br/>Nice photo...frankenstein......J/K.....good luck.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ouch.......you opened that up pretty good. Nice photo...frankenstein......J/K.....good luck. ', '2004-03-01 22:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(605182, 61683, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very funny  shot...nice job.</td>', 'Very funny  shot...nice job.', '2004-03-01 22:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(605186, 62088, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think its a nice shot...fits the challenge well.  Not sure about the frame though.....but a good photo !</td>', 'I think its a nice shot...fits the challenge well.  Not sure about the frame though.....but a good photo !', '2004-03-01 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(605201, 61319, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the conflict here unless you are thinking of past conflicts with the cannon?  Nice shot overall, good contrast but the crop on the bottom left seems a bit tight for some reason to me.  The snow looks a bit blown out but not too badly.  A 6</td>', 'Not sure I get the conflict here unless you are thinking of past conflicts with the cannon?  Nice shot overall, good contrast but the crop on the bottom left seems a bit tight for some reason to me.  The snow looks a bit blown out but not too badly.  A 6', '2004-03-01 23:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(605203, 62106, 12448, '<td valign="top">The eternal conflict, life vs. death.  I see the life through the church but where is the death represented?  The sun is a bit too bright and overpowers the shot.  Also the wall in the front looks noisy for some reason.  A 5</td>', 'The eternal conflict, life vs. death.  I see the life through the church but where is the death represented?  The sun is a bit too bright and overpowers the shot.  Also the wall in the front looks noisy for some reason.  A 5', '2004-03-01 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(605204, 62017, 12448, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, not sure about the conflict really involved, it doesn''t show on her face and honestly, did she need to be nude?  I think this would be much better with her in a halter type top, the nudity ends up distracting from this shot to me.  And before you think I don''t like nudes, I do, if done tastefully as this one was but not always needed.  A 5</td>', 'An interesting shot, not sure about the conflict really involved, it doesn''t show on her face and honestly, did she need to be nude?  I think this would be much better with her in a halter type top, the nudity ends up distracting from this shot to me.  And before you think I don''t like nudes, I do, if done tastefully as this one was but not always needed.  A 5', '2004-03-01 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(605212, 61504, 9047, '<td valign="top">very good representation of the game. the light and the focus are really nice also. congratulations!</td>', 'very good representation of the game. the light and the focus are really nice also. congratulations!', '2004-03-01 23:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
