(605303, 61924, 9906, '<td valign="top">If it''s predator vs prey, I put my money on the big bird....  This is an awesome shot!  Is it really in the wild?  If so I wanna know what lens you used.  This is one of the best (presumably) long lens shots I''ve seen in a LONG time!<br/>TC</td>', 'If it''s predator vs prey, I put my money on the big bird....  This is an awesome shot!  Is it really in the wild?  If so I wanna know what lens you used.  This is one of the best (presumably) long lens shots I''ve seen in a LONG time!TC', '2004-03-02 01:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
