(605305, 62101, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the intent of this shot is.  Looking at the title, I''ll go back to the store and get some chips...  Ain''t no ten second rule on that ground...  Besides not being all that interesting to look at, your focus is off...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not sure what the intent of this shot is.  Looking at the title, I''ll go back to the store and get some chips...  Ain''t no ten second rule on that ground...  Besides not being all that interesting to look at, your focus is off...TC', '2004-03-02 01:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
