(605359, 61964, 17387, '<td valign="top">Eh..  It''s a wonderful photograph..  I don''t like it in this challenge though. 4</td>', 'Eh..  It''s a wonderful photograph..  I don''t like it in this challenge though. 4', '2004-03-02 06:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(605361, 61685, 17387, '<td valign="top">strange..  Interesting shot, good work with the exposure- I don''t know what else to say.  6 would be higher, but it doesn''t meet the challenge very well.</td>', 'strange..  Interesting shot, good work with the exposure- I don''t know what else to say.  6 would be higher, but it doesn''t meet the challenge very well.', '2004-03-02 06:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(605363, 62100, 17387, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photograph..  There are a few elements that stand out here..  The dark bird on the cross is a nice capture...  And the color contrast is great.  The branches add to the framing of the shot..  I guess I would like the shot a lot more if you upped the contrast of the overall shot considerably..  But that is only my aesthetic preference..  excellent work, 7.     I wonder about the title...   Is the conflict supposed to be: nature vs religion?    cold vs bird?  hehe..  anyway, kudos.</td>', 'A very interesting photograph..  There are a few elements that stand out here..  The dark bird on the cross is a nice capture...  And the color contrast is great.  The branches add to the framing of the shot..  I guess I would like the shot a lot more if you upped the contrast of the overall shot considerably..  But that is only my aesthetic preference..  excellent work, 7.     I wonder about the title...   Is the conflict supposed to be: nature vs religion?    cold vs bird?  hehe..  anyway, kudos.', '2004-03-02 06:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(605365, 61456, 17387, '<td valign="top">A loose connection to conflict...  the shot is done nicely though - 6</td>', 'A loose connection to conflict...  the shot is done nicely though - 6', '2004-03-02 07:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
