(606651, 62016, 16033, '<td valign="top">yeah the filters are suppose to overlap, showing a mixture of two contrasting colors. Its also suppose to show one filter in focus and the other out of focus.  And hence the ''conflict'' which didnt turn out  Due to the constrains I had, i couldnt get the desire shot, and at the end I couldn''t be bothered retrying, so I just submitted this one. So I confess I''m just being lazy for this one.</td>', 'yeah the filters are suppose to overlap, showing a mixture of two contrasting colors. Its also suppose to show one filter in focus and the other out of focus.  And hence the ''conflict'' which didnt turn out  Due to the constrains I had, i couldnt get the desire shot, and at the end I couldn''t be bothered retrying, so I just submitted this one. So I confess I''m just being lazy for this one.', '2004-03-03 01:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
