(606738, 62143, 10084, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. I didn''t get to vote on all the images because of computer problems. Excellent angle. The expression on his face is perfect. It really gives you a sense of him on the lookout and taking a quick drink. This is a very powerful image.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. I didn''t get to vote on all the images because of computer problems. Excellent angle. The expression on his face is perfect. It really gives you a sense of him on the lookout and taking a quick drink. This is a very powerful image.', '2004-03-03 03:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(606749, 61482, 17037, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  The story (message) jumps off the page and does not require a label to explain it.  I like the way you captured their expressions, they are in clear focus, and the background is out of focus and does not get in the way.  Well deserving of your top score.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  The story (message) jumps off the page and does not require a label to explain it.  I like the way you captured their expressions, they are in clear focus, and the background is out of focus and does not get in the way.  Well deserving of your top score.', '2004-03-03 03:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(606750, 62143, 17037, '<td valign="top">Very well done Rooster.  Like all good photos it tells the story without requiring a label.  And I like that you shot it in black and white.</td>', 'Very well done Rooster.  Like all good photos it tells the story without requiring a label.  And I like that you shot it in black and white.', '2004-03-03 03:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
