(606764, 62143, 15124, '<td valign="top">Where in the Bronx was this photo taken? Parkchester? Fordham? Castle Hill? Great shot.</td>', 'Where in the Bronx was this photo taken? Parkchester? Fordham? Castle Hill? Great shot.', '2004-03-03 03:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(606765, 61912, 11417, '<td valign="top">Hi all,<br/> <br/>Thank you for your nice comments on "Lighthouse versus the Sea". It was taken in Le Grau d''Agde, in the south of France. The lighthouse marks the end of the river named l''Herault.<br/>The wind coming from the south was really strong that day, and waves bigger than what I have never seen. It''s not usual to see the Mediterranean Sea so upset and I felt that I''ve captured conflict between the Sea and the Lighthouse.<br/>For those who wondered how it was with colours, it was quite the same as the b&amp;w picture. It was so gray and dark that the top of the lighthouse (usually green) was dark.<br/>Anyway, thanks again for your comments and good marks ;)</td>', 'Hi all, Thank you for your nice comments on "Lighthouse versus the Sea". It was taken in Le Grau d''Agde, in the south of France. The lighthouse marks the end of the river named l''Herault.The wind coming from the south was really strong that day, and waves bigger than what I have never seen. It''s not usual to see the Mediterranean Sea so upset and I felt that I''ve captured conflict between the Sea and the Lighthouse.For those who wondered how it was with colours, it was quite the same as the b&w picture. It was so gray and dark that the top of the lighthouse (usually green) was dark.Anyway, thanks again for your comments and good marks ;)', '2004-03-03 03:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(606778, 62123, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow this brings back memories! We used to have a bach out at Raglan and were there nearly every weekend in summer :)</td>', 'Wow this brings back memories! We used to have a bach out at Raglan and were there nearly every weekend in summer :)', '2004-03-03 03:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
