(607428, 62127, 16844, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for your efforts in scoring and commenting.  I am fairly new to dpchallenge but am enjoying it a great deal and even learning a few things!!<br/> <br/>Dick<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all for your efforts in scoring and commenting.  I am fairly new to dpchallenge but am enjoying it a great deal and even learning a few things!! Dick', '2004-03-03 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(607430, 62120, 12475, '<td valign="top">LOL! You totally brightened my day.</td>', 'LOL! You totally brightened my day.', '2004-03-03 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(607435, 62143, 12268, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much everyone! I had lots of fun dreaming this shot up &amp; actually taking it. My model, Devin, was so great! He did exactly what I asked for without complaining or anything. Much love &amp; thanks to him!<br/>Originally I wanted the sign to be more authentic &amp; I had a painted sign all ready but I couldn''t hang it off the wall. Hence the quickie printer job that hurt the shot a bit.<br/>I''m still really taken aback by all the comments &amp; that I actually won a ribbon! Who would of thought! <br/>I think I have been having more fun with my shots lately &amp; am finding creative ways of expressing myself more. Very happy that not only do I think I''m getting better but that it is being affirmed here on this site that I love so much!<br/>This shot was taken in the Crotona part of the Bronx in The Mary Mitchell Family &amp; Youth Center on Mapes Avenue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-03 11:54:30.</i></td>', 'Thanks so much everyone! I had lots of fun dreaming this shot up & actually taking it. My model, Devin, was so great! He did exactly what I asked for without complaining or anything. Much love & thanks to him!Originally I wanted the sign to be more authentic & I had a painted sign all ready but I couldn''t hang it off the wall. Hence the quickie printer job that hurt the shot a bit.I''m still really taken aback by all the comments & that I actually won a ribbon! Who would of thought! I think I have been having more fun with my shots lately & am finding creative ways of expressing myself more. Very happy that not only do I think I''m getting better but that it is being affirmed here on this site that I love so much!This shot was taken in the Crotona part of the Bronx in The Mary Mitchell Family & Youth Center on Mapes Avenue.', '2004-03-03 11:53:10.000000', '2004-03-03 11:54:30.000000', 0),
(607484, 62120, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''re a bizarre individual... very funny!  :)  To go the extra mile, you should have spelled "you''re" as "your," though!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-03 12:20:31.</i></td>', 'You''re a bizarre individual... very funny!  :)  To go the extra mile, you should have spelled "you''re" as "your," though!', '2004-03-03 12:19:46.000000', '2004-03-03 12:20:31.000000', 0),
