(607548, 62128, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Yanik!  Nobody does this kind of picture better than you - I love it.  <br/> <br/>PS - I moved to BC at the end of January.  I miss Ottawa (but I''ll be back to visit, two of my children are at university there).  Take care,<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'Congratulations, Yanik!  Nobody does this kind of picture better than you - I love it.   PS - I moved to BC at the end of January.  I miss Ottawa (but I''ll be back to visit, two of my children are at university there).  Take care, Ursula', '2004-03-03 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(607569, 61482, 12448, '<td valign="top">Excellent, it was my highest scoring shot and would have probably bumped to a 10 if I had time to come back and check it again.  Congrats!<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Excellent, it was my highest scoring shot and would have probably bumped to a 10 if I had time to come back and check it again.  Congrats! Deannda', '2004-03-03 12:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(607610, 62128, 15360, '<td valign="top">This picture will give me a lot to reflect upon in the coming days.  When I first looked at this image it didn''t really appeal to me.  I didn''t relate to it.  Lots of other people have looked at this picture and thought it to be great.<br/> <br/>Today I reflect upon thoughts that maybe if I had spent another 30 seconds, would I have scored it higher.  Given the very close finish between the top 3 pictures I feel partially responsible for the possibility of this picture not doing even better.<br/> <br/>Enough of my personal issues..<br/> <br/>Congrats on finishing in the top 3, well deserved and nicely done.</td>', 'This picture will give me a lot to reflect upon in the coming days.  When I first looked at this image it didn''t really appeal to me.  I didn''t relate to it.  Lots of other people have looked at this picture and thought it to be great. Today I reflect upon thoughts that maybe if I had spent another 30 seconds, would I have scored it higher.  Given the very close finish between the top 3 pictures I feel partially responsible for the possibility of this picture not doing even better. Enough of my personal issues.. Congrats on finishing in the top 3, well deserved and nicely done.', '2004-03-03 13:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(607649, 62120, 255, '<td valign="top">wOot! you did it!! <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif'', strrpos(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif"/> <br/> <br/>p.s. i actually do like it. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-03 13:54:00.</i></td>', 'wOot! you did it!!    p.s. i actually do like it. ;)', '2004-03-03 13:50:46.000000', '2004-03-03 13:54:00.000000', 0),
