(607676, 61475, 17055, '<td valign="top">Can''t beleive you didn''t get higher than you did. I beleive jonpink was right about his comments, unfortunately..... people did score this low due to the reality of the shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-03 14:20:48.</i></td>', 'Can''t beleive you didn''t get higher than you did. I beleive jonpink was right about his comments, unfortunately..... people did score this low due to the reality of the shot.', '2004-03-03 14:20:31.000000', '2004-03-03 14:20:48.000000', 0),
