(607999, 61929, 772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GoldBerry:</b></div><hr/><i> Can''t believe this finished so high, I gave it a 1 for not fitting the challenge, and so did 16 others. But people gave it 12 10''s??!!!!!!!!<br/>Even YOU have to laugh at that! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t laugh.  That means that there are at least 12 other people around here who vote the same way I do.</td>', 'Originally posted by GoldBerry: Can''t believe this finished so high, I gave it a 1 for not fitting the challenge, and so did 16 others. But people gave it 12 10''s??!!!!!!!!Even YOU have to laugh at that!   I didn''t laugh.  That means that there are at least 12 other people around here who vote the same way I do.', '2004-03-03 16:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(608037, 61929, 6405, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GoldBerry:</b></div><hr/><i> Can''t believe this finished so high, I gave it a 1 for not fitting the challenge, and so did 16 others. But people gave it 12 10''s??!!!!!!!!<br/>Even YOU have to laugh at that! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You gave this photo "1" because you can only dream about taking this kind of photo! Jealous !!lol...</td>', 'Originally posted by GoldBerry: Can''t believe this finished so high, I gave it a 1 for not fitting the challenge, and so did 16 others. But people gave it 12 10''s??!!!!!!!!Even YOU have to laugh at that!   You gave this photo "1" because you can only dream about taking this kind of photo! Jealous !!lol...', '2004-03-03 16:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
