(608254, 62120, 714, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...not sure what to think of this shot. <br/> <br/>&lt;soni looks at it again&gt;<br/> <br/>hmmm...scarey, freaky, and well, looks like a cat on fire or somethin.<br/> <br/>You got a brown for this, so I guess i should congratulate you.  Congrats, Jacko!  <br/> <br/>Hey, are you going to sell this? This is going to be worth something someday and I want to be part of that cash flow. :-))<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hmmm...not sure what to think of this shot.  <soni looks at it again> hmmm...scarey, freaky, and well, looks like a cat on fire or somethin. You got a brown for this, so I guess i should congratulate you.  Congrats, Jacko!   Hey, are you going to sell this? This is going to be worth something someday and I want to be part of that cash flow. :-)) ', '2004-03-03 19:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
