(608405, 62128, 17399, '<td valign="top">This was my vote for the best of the bunch. Great idea, great composition, great lighting, GREAT PHOTO. Congrats on the ribbon. I can only hope one of my photos can inspire someone like this has me.</td>', 'This was my vote for the best of the bunch. Great idea, great composition, great lighting, GREAT PHOTO. Congrats on the ribbon. I can only hope one of my photos can inspire someone like this has me.', '2004-03-03 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
