(609720, 61929, 772, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GoldBerry:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jmsetzler:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>You are right... I couldn''t hide it.. I tried :)  You will be as good as I am one day if you keep trying... maybe... well, probably not... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL yeah you''re not pompous at all, my humble apologies :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>How come you haven''t added me to your favorites list yet?  Wanna buy a print?</td>', 'Originally posted by GoldBerry: Originally posted by jmsetzler: You are right... I couldn''t hide it.. I tried :)  You will be as good as I am one day if you keep trying... maybe... well, probably not...   LOL yeah you''re not pompous at all, my humble apologies :-)   How come you haven''t added me to your favorites list yet?  Wanna buy a print?', '2004-03-04 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
