(610991, 61929, 1847, '<td valign="top">Just curious... was this a piece of performance art?  The picture, while admittedly not relevant, produced the conflict?<br/> <br/>Very nice shot, btw.  I rented the 75-300IS for a surf trip once, and was very, very unhappy with it.  I''m thinking I got a bad one, based on what you''re putting out with it.</td>', 'Just curious... was this a piece of performance art?  The picture, while admittedly not relevant, produced the conflict? Very nice shot, btw.  I rented the 75-300IS for a surf trip once, and was very, very unhappy with it.  I''m thinking I got a bad one, based on what you''re putting out with it.', '2004-03-05 15:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
