(615764, 61845, 12448, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>A lovely shot overall, the cropping is very well done and the composition is also well done.  <br/> <br/>It took me a moment to realize what the error in the shot was, the forks instead of spoons.  As for meeting the challenge, it''s a long shot for me.  I don''t see a real conflict per say, just an error in place settings, I guess that would be a conflict of manners?  Hence the title.<br/> <br/>The shot seems a bit grainy and under exposed to me.  The sharpness is also wanting a bit.  A bit more contrast and lighting would really help this shot.  The tablecloth goes well with the overall shot and is not distracting despite the lovely pattern.  <br/> <br/>Good Luck In Future Challenges!<br/> <br/>Deannda<br/>DNeufer@stny.rr.com if you have any questions or want to discuss this further!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! A lovely shot overall, the cropping is very well done and the composition is also well done.   It took me a moment to realize what the error in the shot was, the forks instead of spoons.  As for meeting the challenge, it''s a long shot for me.  I don''t see a real conflict per say, just an error in place settings, I guess that would be a conflict of manners?  Hence the title. The shot seems a bit grainy and under exposed to me.  The sharpness is also wanting a bit.  A bit more contrast and lighting would really help this shot.  The tablecloth goes well with the overall shot and is not distracting despite the lovely pattern.   Good Luck In Future Challenges! DeanndaDNeufer@stny.rr.com if you have any questions or want to discuss this further!', '2004-03-09 22:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
