(692099, 61863, 16703, '<td valign="top">GREETINGS FROM "happy world of criticism club by mehmet"<br/> <br/>this is nice composition but the lighting is not carefully set. a more dramatic lighting preferably from the sides would improve this image immensely. with this lighting scheme there are some unpleasent shadows in the wall and the object detail seems to have been sacrificed, leading to overexposure in least wanted areas.. nice try nevertheless.. keep shooting..<br/> <br/>"better world through subjective criticism"</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM "happy world of criticism club by mehmet" this is nice composition but the lighting is not carefully set. a more dramatic lighting preferably from the sides would improve this image immensely. with this lighting scheme there are some unpleasent shadows in the wall and the object detail seems to have been sacrificed, leading to overexposure in least wanted areas.. nice try nevertheless.. keep shooting.. "better world through subjective criticism"', '2004-04-30 18:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
