(1396776, 62121, 13688, '<td valign="top">Comments like these will one day help me get over my addiction to this site.  I need to add more pics like this to my favorites to remember that.  This is what photography to me is all about.  Capturing life at the perfect moment.  In your case minus the arm of the extra guy sitting at the table.  But none-the-less an extremely intriguing shot due to the composition, the lighting, and that there''s so much going on to think about.  Luckily, these are the type of images that you find in galleries, not water droplets on glass.  Of course you also find all white paintings  in modern galleries, but I''ll save that for another rant.  I''m going to personally go through everyone one on this list who posted an unwarranted negative comment and take them off of my christmas card email list.</td>', 'Comments like these will one day help me get over my addiction to this site.  I need to add more pics like this to my favorites to remember that.  This is what photography to me is all about.  Capturing life at the perfect moment.  In your case minus the arm of the extra guy sitting at the table.  But none-the-less an extremely intriguing shot due to the composition, the lighting, and that there''s so much going on to think about.  Luckily, these are the type of images that you find in galleries, not water droplets on glass.  Of course you also find all white paintings  in modern galleries, but I''ll save that for another rant.  I''m going to personally go through everyone one on this list who posted an unwarranted negative comment and take them off of my christmas card email list.', '2005-05-18 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
